WEBVTT

1
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.000
[Taiyi] Over the course
of 1,000 years,

2
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.000
the spiritual energy
of heaven and earth

3
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.000
gave birth to the Chaos Pearl.

4
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Feeding off the sun and moon,

5
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.000
its power grew
at an unstoppable rate.

6
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.000
The divine and demonic
life forces it absorbed

7
00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.000
fused together,

8
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.000
making it unstoppable
and no less hungry.

9
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.000
So my master,
the supreme lord of heaven,

10
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.000
sent my brother and I
to put a stop to the chaos.

11
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.000
I know what you're thinking,

12
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.000
"Who's that dashing rogue
on the pig?"

13
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.000
That would be me, Taiyi Zhenren.

14
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.000
And If I weren't so busy
being a super impressive

15
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.000
butt-kicking, day-saving monk,

16
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.000
I've been told
I could be a model.

17
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.000
[sizzles]

18
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.000
-[Shen] Chaos Pearl.
-[gasps]

19
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.000
You can't escape.

20
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.000
-This is the end of the line.
-[rasps, crackles]

21
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.000
-[sizzles]
-Don't scare it, you big meanie.

22
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.000
Go on. There's a good pearl.

23
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.000
Come here. Here, boy!

24
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.000
[whirring]

25
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.000
[Taiyi] Or girl?

26
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.000
[growling]

27
00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.000
[gasps]

28
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.000
Uh...

29
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.000
[grunting]

30
00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.000
[screaming]

31
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.000
[chuckles]

32
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.000
[grunts]

33
00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.000
[sword clanks]

34
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.000
[explosion]

35
00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.000
[whooshes]

36
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.000
[stutters]
It's over!

37
00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.000
[electricity crackling]

38
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.000
[roars]

39
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.000
It absorbs energy!

40
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.000
[growling]

41
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.000
[crackling]

42
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.000
[Shen gasps]

43
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.000
[yelping]

44
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.000
[groans]
You bruised my moneymaker.

45
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.000
Someone needs a time out.

46
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.000
[growling]

47
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.000
[grunts, groans]

48
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.000
[whistles]

49
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.000
[whooshes]

50
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.000
[whooshing continues]

51
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.000
[Chaos Pearl growls]

52
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:36.000
Hit me now. I dare ya!

53
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.000
[growling]

54
00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.000
[chuckles]

55
00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.000
I was just playin' around?

56
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.000
-[thudding]
-[groaning]

57
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.000
[Taiyi grunting]

58
00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.000
[chiming]

59
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.000
[chiming continues]

60
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.000
[whooshes]

61
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.000
-[thuds]
-[Taiyi groans]

62
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.000
[whirs, thuds]

63
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.000
-[Taiyi] Master!
-[Shen] Master!

64
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.000
[flame roars]

65
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.000
[growling]

66
00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.000
[shrieks]

67
00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.000
[Supreme Lord] I have divided
the Chaos Pearl into two parts,

68
00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.000
The Spirit Pearl
and the Demon Pill.

69
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:36.000
The Demon Pill is dangerous
and nearly indestructible.

70
00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.000
I'm casting a heaven-made curse,

71
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.000
a lightning bolt that
will seek out and destroy it

72
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.000
in three years' time.

73
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.000
Until that day,
you must stay vigilant

74
00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.000
and watch over it.

75
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:52.000
Li Jing has won my favor
in battle.

76
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.000
And so, the Spirit Pearl

77
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.000
will be reincarnated
into his third-born son.

78
00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:03.000
I shall entrust this task
to you, my disciple.

79
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.000
Huh?

80
00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.000
-[gasps]
-Right now,

81
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.000
Eleven Golden Immortals
sit beside me.

82
00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.000
If the pearl
is successfully reincarnated,

83
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.000
then you shall join me

84
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.000
-in the Court of Heaven.
-[gasps]

85
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.000
You can count on me, master.

86
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Thank you so much!

87
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.000
Once the Spirit Pearl is born

88
00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.000
call him...

89
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.000
Ne Zha.

90
00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.000
[upbeat music]

91
00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.000
[Taiyi singing]
¶ I love a party ¶

92
00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.000
¶ And parties love me ¶

93
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.000
¶ It's baby time ¶

94
00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.000
[gulping]

95
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.000
Mm! Ha!

96
00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.000
[Taiyi] How 'bout a swiggy
for the piggy?

97
00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.000
-[laughing]
-[sloshing]

98
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.000
[calm music]

99
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.000
[crowd murmuring]

100
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.000
-[grunts]
-Please.

101
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.000
-[Lady Yin grunts]
-[Li Jing gasps]

102
00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.000
[Li Jing] Careful.

103
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.000
[munching]

104
00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.000
Dear, you should worship too.

105
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.000
[munches]
Why didn't I think of that?

106
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.000
I've only been pregnant
for three years!

107
00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.000
-[clattering]
-[gasps]

108
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:25.000
[both grunting]

109
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:30.000
[gasps, grunts]

110
00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.000
[clears throat]
From the Cave of Golden Light,

111
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.000
my name is Taiyi Zhen...

112
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.000
-[thuds]
-...ren.

113
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.000
-[kid 1] Come on.
-[kid 2] Wait for me!

114
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.000
-Hurry up! Move it, slowpoke!
-[kid 3] Come on!

115
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.000
-Yeah, slowpoke!
-Come on!

116
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.000
This is so exciting.

117
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:54.000
A third son! Congratulations!
[grunts]

118
00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.000
I'll be a matchmaker
for the little man.

119
00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.000
We wrote him a song.
Wanna hear it?

120
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.000
[upbeat music plays]

121
00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.000
Thank you for your concern
and well-wishes, my friends.

122
00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:08.000
But for now, please remain calm
and quiet.

123
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.000
[Li Xin]
Just wait for the good news

124
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.000
-and we'll alert you...
-[paper rasps]

125
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.000
...as soon as he's here.

126
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.000
[screaming]

127
00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.000
I can't take it!
[groans]

128
00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.000
[screaming]

129
00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.000
He approaches.

130
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.000
-Or I think.
-[chuckling]

131
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.000
Master Immortal,
I have something for you...

132
00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.000
I can't drink now.
That'd be so unprofessional.

133
00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.000
I'll just leave it here.

134
00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.000
I have important things to do.
Take it away.

135
00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.000
Hey.

136
00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.000
Ah, some people
just don't listen.

137
00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.000
Well, one sip can't hurt!
[chuckles]

138
00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.000
Don't want it going to waste!

139
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.000
[gulping]

140
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.000
That's nice.

141
00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.000
I mean, I'm basically
almost done. So...

142
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.000
[gulping]

143
00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.000
[burps]

144
00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.000
[chuckling]

145
00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.000
Enjoy your enchanted
three-day nap!

146
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.000
-[sizzles]
-Ah!

147
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.000
[groaning, screaming]

148
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.000
I knew it! A spell was cast,

149
00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:17.000
so only Taiyi
would be able to move it.

150
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.000
[groaning, screams]

151
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.000
[breathes deeply]

152
00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.000
Your highness.

153
00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.000
The immortal's spell
must be cast soon!

154
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.000
Has the time come?

155
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.000
-[Li Xin grunts]
-What's wrong?

156
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.000
He passed out,
I think he's drunk.

157
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.000
-He's what?
-I guess we'll have to do it

158
00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.000
the hard way.

159
00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.000
-[inhales deeply]
-Now hold on.

160
00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.000
We can't just go beating up
on the man.

161
00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.000
He's an immortal. It's wrong!

162
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.000
Milord!
She won't last much longer!

163
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.000
Out of the way!

164
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.000
[rapid grunting]

165
00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.000
[gasping]

166
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.000
-[thuds]
-[tree creaks]

167
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:56.000
[retches]

168
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.000
Oh, you wouldn't believe
the crazy dream I just had.

169
00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.000
I beg you. Open the lotus!

170
00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:04.000
Oh, yeah! I knew
there was something I forgot!

171
00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.000
[Taiyi groans]

172
00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.000
Go on! Is something wrong?

173
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.000
I can't remember the password.

174
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.000
[both gasp]

175
00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.000
That was some
crazy strong stuff!

176
00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.000
Okay, let's see, uh...

177
00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.000
[beeps]

178
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.000
No big deal!
I have four more tries.

179
00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:32.000
[beeps]

180
00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.000
-[beeping continues]
-[whirs]

181
00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.000
[beeps]

182
00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.000
What the heck?

183
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.000
And if you're wrong
a fifth time?

184
00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.000
It locks itself

185
00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.000
and we can try again
in ten years.

186
00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.000
[both gasp, groan]

187
00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.000
[grunting]

188
00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.000
Come, out!
[exhales deeply]

189
00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.000
Milord! The lady has fainted!

190
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.000
Oh, I got it!

191
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.000
-Don't!
-Is he mad?

192
00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.000
[both gasp]

193
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.000
[clicking]

194
00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.000
[Taiyi chuckles]
I just remembered.

195
00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.000
If you forget the password,

196
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.000
you can just verify
with a handprint.

197
00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.000
[both sigh]

198
00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.000
Look over there,
it's happy hour!

199
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.000
Huh?

200
00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.000
[gasps]

201
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.000
I knew something felt off
with you.

202
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.000
Look! A Slave Rune.

203
00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.000
Huh?

204
00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.000
Huh?

205
00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.000
[laughing]

206
00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.000
[gasps]
He's got control of her!

207
00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.000
You want it so badly?

208
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.000
Okay, I'll give one back.

209
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.000
-[whirs]
-Halt!

210
00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:38.000
[screaming]

211
00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.000
[gasps]

212
00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.000
-Oh, boy.
-[Li Jing grunting]

213
00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:44.000
[gasping]

214
00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.000
[whooshing]

215
00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.000
[explosion]

216
00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.000
[crowd gasp, jeer]

217
00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:05.000
[ominous music]

218
00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:10.000
[laughing]

219
00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.000
Milord! I'm not sure
what happened but...

220
00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.000
-[gasps]
-What?

221
00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.000
[gasps, whimpers]

222
00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.000
-[growls]
-[crowd murmuring]

223
00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.000
[all gasp, whimper]

224
00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:44.000
[shrieks]

225
00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:49.000
[crowd screaming]

226
00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.000
[grunts]

227
00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.000
-[cooing]
-Gotcha!

228
00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.000
You're not going anywhere,
buddy--

229
00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.000
[yelping]

230
00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.000
-[grumbles]
-[flames roar]

231
00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:04.000
[crowd gasping]

232
00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.000
[flames crackling]

233
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.000
[tense music]

234
00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.000
[all whimper]

235
00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:42.000
[crowd clamoring]

236
00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.000
[both gasp]

237
00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.000
Watch out!

238
00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.000
Ah, he's getting away.

239
00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.000
-[grunts]
-[chiming]

240
00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.000
With the power of sun and moon,
of sea and sand,

241
00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:05.000
Qiankun Hoop, obey my command!

242
00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.000
[chiming]

243
00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.000
[baby Ne Zha gasps]

244
00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.000
[thudding]

245
00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.000
Hold!

246
00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:24.000
-[clinks]
-[whimpering]

247
00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.000
-[baby Ne Zha grunting]
-Take this, you little demon!

248
00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.000
-That's my son!
-No.

249
00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.000
That's the reincarnation
of the Demon Pill

250
00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.000
-and he's bad news!
-[wailing]

251
00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.000
If he didn't have
the Qiankun Hoop containing him,

252
00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.000
he'd unleash a reign of terror
like the world's never seen.

253
00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.000
[growling, screams]

254
00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.000
Go back where you belong!

255
00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:46.000
-[Lady Yin] No!
-[Taiyi grunting]

256
00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.000
[groans, exhales]

257
00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.000
My love!

258
00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.000
Please don't hurt him.

259
00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.000
Don't hurt my child!

260
00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.000
But...

261
00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.000
[Old Man] Lord Li!

262
00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.000
For generations
we have battled against demons.

263
00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.000
Do you think it wise
to endanger our people

264
00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.000
by letting one live among us?

265
00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:08.000
As the leader of Chentang Pass,

266
00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.000
I hope you can consider
the greater good

267
00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.000
and do what's right.

268
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.000
He's over there.

269
00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.000
YOU HAVE A SON!

270
00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.000
MY CONDOLENCES

271
00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.000
[grunting, chomps]

272
00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.000
You see that?

273
00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.000
I'm here. Don't be scared.

274
00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.000
[coos]

275
00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.000
[calm music]

276
00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.000
[baby Ne Zha coos]

277
00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.000
Your Grace. Everyone...

278
00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:44.000
My family is unfortunate.
This I know.

279
00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.000
[Li Jing] But my son
is also just a victim

280
00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.000
of this misfortune.

281
00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.000
And I'm not of the mind
to kill an innocent child.

282
00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.000
I will take care
of Ne Zha's education,

283
00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:55.000
and I promise he won't set foot
in the village.

284
00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.000
If he brings you any harm,

285
00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:59.000
then I will receive
your punishment.

286
00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.000
I'm willing to pay
the ultimate price.

287
00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.000
[sighs]
Even if we spare him.

288
00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.000
He'll only have three years.

289
00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.000
The Supreme Lord
put a curse on the Pill

290
00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.000
so three years from today,

291
00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.000
a lightning bolt will strike him
and take his life.

292
00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.000
-[gasps]
-Oh.

293
00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.000
His curse can't be broken.

294
00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:19.000
I'll convince him
to have it removed.

295
00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:22.000
Don't worry. my darling.
I will protect our child.

296
00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.000
[sobbing]

297
00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:32.000
[cooing]

298
00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:35.000
[baby Ne Zha blabbers]

299
00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.000
[waves crashing]

300
00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.000
[splashes]

301
00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:58.000
[ominous music]

302
00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.000
Finally...

303
00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:23.000
[Dragon King]
This is the Spirit Pearl?

304
00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:26.000
If I infuse it into an egg...

305
00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:30.000
That means my son
will be all-powerful.

306
00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.000
Unstoppable.

307
00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.000
And my child will become a god?

308
00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.000
[stutters]
You'll never...

309
00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:41.000
-Never what?
-Fail, sir!

310
00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.000
Oh, very well.

311
00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.000
[growling]

312
00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:57.000
[chiming]

313
00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.000
[cracking]

314
00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:06.000
[Dragon King]
This is my son, Ao Bing.

315
00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.000
As agreed,
I will entrust him to you

316
00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.000
and he shall call you master.

317
00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.000
On the condition
you help free him

318
00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.000
from this underwater purgatory.

319
00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:19.000
And he joins Heaven's Court.

320
00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.000
-I can't...
-You can't?

321
00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.000
[stutters]
...can't be defeated.

322
00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.000
I'm going to prove to you

323
00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:29.000
that you've put your trust
in the most worthy immortal.

324
00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.000
Next time...

325
00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:35.000
Could you do me a favor
and just nod?

326
00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:39.000
[wings fluttering]

327
00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:44.000
[Taiyi] That right there
is a void portal.

328
00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.000
The Supreme Lord entered
a realm beyond the three worlds,

329
00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:50.000
so this door is the only way
we can get to him.

330
00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:55.000
Supreme Lord! It is I!
Your disciple, Taiyi.

331
00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:58.000
[Chang imitating Supreme Lord]
Taiyi, do you understand

332
00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.000
what you've done?

333
00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.000
Yes, I know I messed up

334
00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.000
but it's not really my fault
because there was a demon and--

335
00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.000
[Chang imitating Supreme Lord]
Ah! No excuses!

336
00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.000
What took you so long to see me?

337
00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.000
I get so bored by myself.

338
00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.000
Ah! It's just you.

339
00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.000
This is Chang ShengYun.

340
00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.000
He's in charge
of the void portal.

341
00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.000
But we just call him
Clingy Cloud.

342
00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.000
Oh, yeah?
Well, we call you fatty!

343
00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.000
Hello, new friend.

344
00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.000
Not in front of company.
Treat me with some respect!

345
00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.000
And this is Li Jing,

346
00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.000
-Commander of Chengtang Pass.
-A pleasure! Really!

347
00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.000
It's a party! I have company!

348
00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.000
[Chang] Oh, yes, sit, sit!
Here, have some tea.

349
00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.000
It's hard sitting here
guarding the gate every day.

350
00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.000
So what's new with the mortals?

351
00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.000
I've been out of the loop
for so long.

352
00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.000
Please relay
to the Supreme Lord.

353
00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.000
We seek an audience with him.

354
00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.000
Huh? I'm sorry but...

355
00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.000
Unfortunately, our master
and some of his god pals

356
00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.000
went to the void portal.

357
00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.000
Probably attending
to godly matters.

358
00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.000
But why do you want to see him?
Do tell, do tell.

359
00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.000
Someone's under
a heaven-made curse,

360
00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.000
and I want him to call it off.

361
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.000
[gasps]
Say it ain't so!

362
00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.000
Then it's useless
to speak to him.

363
00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.000
That curse is unbreakable.

364
00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.000
[gasps]

365
00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.000
[Li Jing exhales deeply]

366
00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.000
One day here is a year there.

367
00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.000
Which means back on earth,

368
00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.000
a great deal of time
has already passed.

369
00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.000
We need to head back
as soon as possible.

370
00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.000
Maybe there's something
we can do for him.

371
00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:20.000
[somber music]

372
00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.000
[Ne Zha grunts]

373
00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.000
[Ne Zha] These dumb walls
crush my soul.

374
00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.000
Even prisoners get parole.

375
00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.000
No friends, no fun,

376
00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.000
it's just the worst.

377
00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:40.000
Hopefully boredom
will get me first.

378
00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:43.000
Ne Zha.
What're you doing up there?

379
00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:46.000
Can't go outside
and nobody will play with me.

380
00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:50.000
So what else can I do
but check out the sights?

381
00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.000
Then-- Oh!

382
00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.000
Why don't you describe
the scenery to mommy?

383
00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:56.000
Grass, trees, and dumb flowers.

384
00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.000
And a guy showing his butt.

385
00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.000
Oh, you with your jokes.

386
00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.000
Hey. Why don't I play with you?

387
00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.000
Don't mess with me.

388
00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.000
You don't have more demons
to fight or something?

389
00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:08.000
This is the first time
I've seen you in forever.

390
00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.000
You never have time to play.

391
00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:14.000
I know. I know this is hard.

392
00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.000
I would love to play more, baby,

393
00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.000
however the fortress
needs protecting.

394
00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.000
I can't be everywhere at once.

395
00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.000
Uh...

396
00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.000
But today has been peaceful.

397
00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.000
How does playing jianzi
sound to you?

398
00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.000
[grunts, spits]

399
00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:31.000
Well since you're so bored
I guess I can play with you.

400
00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.000
[both gasp]

401
00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.000
[grunting]

402
00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.000
Ready? Go!

403
00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:40.000
[grunting]

404
00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:44.000
[grunting continues]

405
00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.000
Milady. I think you should
put your armor on.

406
00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.000
You must be joking.

407
00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.000
He is my son and we're playing.

408
00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.000
Nobody's died from jianzi.

409
00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.000
Catch...

410
00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.000
[grunts]
...this!

411
00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:57.000
Ready--
[grunts]

412
00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:59.000
Uh, you okay, ma?

413
00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:01.000
I'm fine! I'm fine!

414
00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.000
Good shot!

415
00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.000
On second thought...

416
00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:06.000
Did I kick it too hard?

417
00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:09.000
No. Kick as hard as you want!

418
00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.000
-You two, join in.
-[both gasp]

419
00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:14.000
[thuds]

420
00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:18.000
[thudding continues]

421
00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.000
[sighs, panting]

422
00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:24.000
[soldier] Maybe you should rest.

423
00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:28.000
No. I'm alright.

424
00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:32.000
[Lady Yin] Look at how much fun
Ne Zha's having.

425
00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:36.000
It's been a long time since
he smiled like that.

426
00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:40.000
[both] That's wonderful
for him, milady.

427
00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.000
[scout] Report!

428
00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.000
An eel spirit's destroying
the eastern fishing village.

429
00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:45.000
We need reinforcements.

430
00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:47.000
-Mom, catch!
-[gasps]

431
00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.000
[chuckles]

432
00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.000
Sweetie...

433
00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:00.000
[Lady Yin] We're going to
have to call it a day.

434
00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.000
But next time...

435
00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.000
We can play as long as you want.

436
00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:06.000
I promise.

437
00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:08.000
-[gasps]
-That's what you said last time.

438
00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:10.000
[Ne Zha] It's fine.
I'm used to it by now.

439
00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:13.000
[Lady Yin] I'll cook
your favorite when I come home!

440
00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:23.000
[whooshes]

441
00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.000
[somber music]

442
00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:41.000
-[both snoring]
-[clatters]

443
00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:43.000
-Huh?
-Huh?

444
00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:47.000
[both chuckling]

445
00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.000
[Lady Yin] And you two.

446
00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:53.000
Master Immortal Taiyi
brought you here

447
00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:54.000
to protect the barrier,

448
00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.000
not so you can
be flashy mascots.

449
00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:59.000
Do not allow him
to get out anymore.

450
00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:01.000
Don't worry.
I guarded the southern boundary.

451
00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:03.000
And it's his fault
Ne Zha got out last time.

452
00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:06.000
You are so f-full of it!
The north was secured.

453
00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:08.000
He's clearly guilty.
Just look at this guy!

454
00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:11.000
Huh?
You turn that finger around!

455
00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:13.000
Once Taiyi Zhenren returns,
you just wait!

456
00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:16.000
Cause I'm sure
he loves to hear you whine!

457
00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:19.000
That's it! Fight me.
Come on, you wanna go?

458
00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:21.000
-Bring it! I ain't scared!
-Oh, yeah, chicken?

459
00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:23.000
-Chicken? You are!
-Ah!

460
00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:25.000
-[both grunting]
-Cut it--

461
00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.000
-I'll show you a chicken.
-Who's the chicken?

462
00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:28.000
-Chicken says "what?"
-[imitating chicken noise]

463
00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:31.000
-Huh?
-Huh?

464
00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:33.000
[both grunt]

465
00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:41.000
-[rock clinks]
-Huh?

466
00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:43.000
[growls]

467
00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:46.000
Huh? What? Whatcha lookin' at?

468
00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:48.000
-[scoffs]
-Huh?

469
00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:52.000
[snarls]

470
00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:57.000
-[rock clanks]
-[growling]

471
00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:59.000
[grunts]
What's the big idea--

472
00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.000
[both grunting]

473
00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:03.000
[grunting continues]

474
00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.000
Body Slam!

475
00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:07.000
[both grunting]

476
00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:09.000
-[clatters]
-Dragon Whip!

477
00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:10.000
Crabby Sea Monster!

478
00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:11.000
[both groan]

479
00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:14.000
Immortal Picking Grapes!

480
00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:17.000
Come on, Dad!
[chuckles]

481
00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.000
[indistinct chatter]

482
00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:22.000
-[Ne Zha] One!
-Huh?

483
00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:24.000
Two!
[Ne Zha chuckles]

484
00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:26.000
[shrieks]
He's out again!

485
00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:29.000
[whimpering]

486
00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.000
[crowd clamoring]

487
00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:33.000
[Ne Zha] Three!

488
00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:36.000
-[crowd clamoring]
-[Ne Zha] Four!

489
00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:40.000
-Five.
-[grunts]

490
00:24:40.000 --> 00:24:43.000
[Ne Zha] Six!

491
00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:45.000
Seven!

492
00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:48.000
-[gasps]
-[Ne Zha] Eight.

493
00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:51.000
Nine!

494
00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:54.000
Ten.

495
00:24:54.000 --> 00:24:56.000
Ready or not...

496
00:24:56.000 --> 00:24:59.000
[all whimpering]

497
00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:03.000
-[screams]
-[crowd jeer]

498
00:25:06.000 --> 00:25:07.000
[screams]

499
00:25:07.000 --> 00:25:10.000
[crowd clamoring]

500
00:25:10.000 --> 00:25:13.000
-[Ne Zha chuckling]
-[thudding]

501
00:25:14.000 --> 00:25:17.000
[people screaming]

502
00:25:19.000 --> 00:25:22.000
[clamoring]

503
00:25:23.000 --> 00:25:26.000
[whimpers]

504
00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:27.000
[sighs]

505
00:25:27.000 --> 00:25:29.000
-[thudding]
-[groaning]

506
00:25:29.000 --> 00:25:32.000
[whimpers]

507
00:25:33.000 --> 00:25:35.000
Huh?

508
00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:37.000
[chuckles]

509
00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:41.000
-[thuds]
-[groans]

510
00:25:46.000 --> 00:25:47.000
[boy 1] I've had enough.

511
00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:49.000
Let's fight.

512
00:25:49.000 --> 00:25:51.000
But boss. There's no way
we can beat Ne Zha.

513
00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:53.000
Not true!

514
00:25:53.000 --> 00:25:55.000
Are we, or are we not
The Demonhunters Gang?

515
00:25:55.000 --> 00:25:57.000
Until we can figure out a way...

516
00:25:57.000 --> 00:25:59.000
no one goes home!

517
00:25:59.000 --> 00:26:01.000
-[thudding]
-[all] Huh?

518
00:26:03.000 --> 00:26:05.000
I have a way, boss!

519
00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:07.000
Huh? I told you to keep guard.

520
00:26:07.000 --> 00:26:09.000
Go back.

521
00:26:09.000 --> 00:26:11.000
I was thinking
we could set some traps.

522
00:26:11.000 --> 00:26:13.000
Like what?

523
00:26:13.000 --> 00:26:14.000
Check this out!

524
00:26:14.000 --> 00:26:16.000
[masked boy] Ne Zha's gonna
come down that bridge,

525
00:26:16.000 --> 00:26:18.000
but he won't know I
cut the ropes...

526
00:26:18.000 --> 00:26:19.000
- And bam!
-Ah!

527
00:26:19.000 --> 00:26:21.000
[masked boy]
When he hits the ground,

528
00:26:21.000 --> 00:26:23.000
it'll trigger the second trap,

529
00:26:23.000 --> 00:26:25.000
an overhead basket filled
with sharp pointy objects!

530
00:26:25.000 --> 00:26:27.000
-[screaming]
-[masked boy] He'll reach

531
00:26:27.000 --> 00:26:29.000
for the nearest shield,
which will be an old pan.

532
00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:30.000
But surprise!

533
00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:32.000
There's another trap
within that trap!

534
00:26:32.000 --> 00:26:34.000
[screams]

535
00:26:34.000 --> 00:26:36.000
[masked boy]
He'll run and run and run...

536
00:26:36.000 --> 00:26:38.000
And "What's that?
A safe space to hide?"

537
00:26:38.000 --> 00:26:39.000
But not so fast...

538
00:26:39.000 --> 00:26:42.000
- Lift-off!
-[Ne Zha screaming]

539
00:26:42.000 --> 00:26:43.000
[masked boy] Boom!

540
00:26:43.000 --> 00:26:44.000
- But better watch out...
-[groans]

541
00:26:44.000 --> 00:26:46.000
for that venomous snake!

542
00:26:46.000 --> 00:26:50.000
And he'll start climbing
the rope ladder near the tree.

543
00:26:50.000 --> 00:26:51.000
Which should make
all those hornets

544
00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:54.000
in the hornet's nest I put there
really mad.

545
00:26:54.000 --> 00:26:55.000
-[buzzing]
-[screaming]

546
00:26:55.000 --> 00:26:57.000
[masked boy]If he doesn't want
to get stung so bad

547
00:26:57.000 --> 00:26:58.000
his head swells like a balloon,

548
00:26:58.000 --> 00:27:00.000
he'll have to jump
into the mud pit.

549
00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:03.000
And when he finally crawls out,

550
00:27:03.000 --> 00:27:06.000
he'll be so scared and angry
smoke will come out of his ears.

551
00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:08.000
Nice! I never noticed
how clever you were.

552
00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:11.000
I'd have to be smart to hang out
with someone like you.

553
00:27:11.000 --> 00:27:12.000
[laughing]

554
00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:14.000
You know, when you're right,
you're right.

555
00:27:14.000 --> 00:27:16.000
But he needs
something way worse.

556
00:27:16.000 --> 00:27:19.000
I got it, let's add some sea
urchins to the pit!

557
00:27:19.000 --> 00:27:20.000
That'll do the trick.

558
00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:22.000
[boy 1] It's important for him
to stay hydrated.

559
00:27:22.000 --> 00:27:23.000
[all laugh]

560
00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:26.000
Um, guys?
You don't think that's too mean?

561
00:27:26.000 --> 00:27:28.000
Huh? He's mean.

562
00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:29.000
He humiliates us so

563
00:27:29.000 --> 00:27:31.000
-we're just returning the favor.
-Yes.

564
00:27:31.000 --> 00:27:32.000
-Yeah. That's right!
-Yeah. Exactly.

565
00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:35.000
All right. Well you're the boss.

566
00:27:35.000 --> 00:27:37.000
Who am I to disagree?

567
00:27:37.000 --> 00:27:40.000
Hold on. I just had
an important thought.

568
00:27:40.000 --> 00:27:42.000
-What is it?
-If our plan starts with Ne Zha

569
00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:44.000
on the bridge,
how do we get him there?

570
00:27:44.000 --> 00:27:46.000
That part's easy.

571
00:27:46.000 --> 00:27:47.000
We can scare him onto it.

572
00:27:47.000 --> 00:27:49.000
-Huh?
-Like how?

573
00:27:49.000 --> 00:27:52.000
Like...
[shouts]

574
00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:55.000
[boys screaming]

575
00:27:57.000 --> 00:28:01.000
[upbeat music]

576
00:28:01.000 --> 00:28:03.000
[boys scream]

577
00:28:06.000 --> 00:28:08.000
-[hornets buzzing]
-[boys screaming]

578
00:28:08.000 --> 00:28:11.000
-[screaming continues]
-[splashes]

579
00:28:14.000 --> 00:28:15.000
[all sigh, gasp]

580
00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:18.000
[laughing]

581
00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:20.000
You were right about one thing.

582
00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:23.000
It's important to stay hydrated!

583
00:28:23.000 --> 00:28:25.000
You guys! You guys!

584
00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:26.000
-He beat me up.
-Huh?

585
00:28:26.000 --> 00:28:28.000
And he took all my clothes!

586
00:28:28.000 --> 00:28:30.000
Well fellas, it's been real.

587
00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:32.000
You guys are a lot of fun.

588
00:28:32.000 --> 00:28:34.000
Yeah? Laugh all you want.

589
00:28:34.000 --> 00:28:36.000
You demon!

590
00:28:38.000 --> 00:28:41.000
What did you just call me?

591
00:28:41.000 --> 00:28:42.000
-I said...
-[boys gasp]

592
00:28:42.000 --> 00:28:46.000
-you're a demon!
-No!

593
00:28:48.000 --> 00:28:51.000
[growling]

594
00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:55.000
[grunts]

595
00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:03.000
[rumbling]

596
00:29:04.000 --> 00:29:07.000
[gasping]

597
00:29:09.000 --> 00:29:10.000
-[Li Jing] Ne Zha!
-[growls]

598
00:29:10.000 --> 00:29:13.000
That'll be enough of that.

599
00:29:13.000 --> 00:29:15.000
-[Li Jing] Boundary Beasts!
-[both] Sir!

600
00:29:15.000 --> 00:29:17.000
[Li Jing] Tighten the boundary.

601
00:29:17.000 --> 00:29:19.000
He's now prohibited from
setting foot outside this room.

602
00:29:19.000 --> 00:29:22.000
-[both] Sir!
-[clinks]

603
00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:32.000
[somber music]

604
00:29:32.000 --> 00:29:34.000
Enough.

605
00:29:38.000 --> 00:29:41.000
We expected
this might happen one day.

606
00:29:41.000 --> 00:29:43.000
We tried but...

607
00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:46.000
maybe this is just his fate.

608
00:29:48.000 --> 00:29:51.000
Even after forbidding them
from mentioning the word demon,

609
00:29:51.000 --> 00:29:53.000
people will never see him
as anything but.

610
00:29:53.000 --> 00:29:55.000
And I've been so busy
fighting monsters

611
00:29:55.000 --> 00:29:57.000
to gain goodwill on his behalf.

612
00:29:57.000 --> 00:30:01.000
[inhales deeply]
I've neglected my boy.

613
00:30:02.000 --> 00:30:05.000
He only has two years left.

614
00:30:07.000 --> 00:30:09.000
[Lady Yin] Let's resign our
positions.

615
00:30:09.000 --> 00:30:10.000
Take him to play
in the mountains,

616
00:30:10.000 --> 00:30:12.000
and just be with him.

617
00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:14.000
Until the end.

618
00:30:18.000 --> 00:30:22.000
[stutters]
Uh, Lady Yin? This is on me.

619
00:30:22.000 --> 00:30:24.000
So I've decided to take him on
as an apprentice.

620
00:30:24.000 --> 00:30:26.000
I'll shape the Demon Pill

621
00:30:26.000 --> 00:30:29.000
into a demon-fighting
warrior of justice.

622
00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:31.000
Is that our only option?

623
00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:33.000
To put him through all that?

624
00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:37.000
Shouldn't we just let him
enjoy the time he's got?

625
00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:41.000
I do not wish to rob him
of a meaningful life.

626
00:30:41.000 --> 00:30:43.000
And would you want this?

627
00:30:43.000 --> 00:30:46.000
For him to be remembered as
a demon?

628
00:30:52.000 --> 00:30:54.000
[Li Xin] Master Ne Zha!

629
00:30:54.000 --> 00:30:56.000
Time for breakfast.

630
00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:01.000
-[clattering]
-[both gasp]

631
00:31:01.000 --> 00:31:02.000
-Huh?
-[Li Xin gasping]

632
00:31:02.000 --> 00:31:04.000
The young Master's
escaped again.

633
00:31:04.000 --> 00:31:06.000
[both] What? Oh, no!

634
00:31:06.000 --> 00:31:08.000
[all panting]

635
00:31:11.000 --> 00:31:12.000
-What?
-[whimpering]

636
00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:14.000
-That's impossible.
-Mm-hm.

637
00:31:14.000 --> 00:31:15.000
-I agree.
-Don't stand there!

638
00:31:15.000 --> 00:31:17.000
Report this to Master Li.

639
00:31:17.000 --> 00:31:19.000
[sighs deeply]

640
00:31:19.000 --> 00:31:22.000
-You can count on me!
-I'm on it.

641
00:31:22.000 --> 00:31:26.000
[scoffs]
There's no guard alive...

642
00:31:26.000 --> 00:31:29.000
who can keep me locked up.

643
00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:35.000
Huh?

644
00:31:36.000 --> 00:31:38.000
[Ne Zha] Wha--

645
00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:42.000
Eh?

646
00:31:43.000 --> 00:31:45.000
[chiming]

647
00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:47.000
[screams]

648
00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:52.000
[screaming continues]

649
00:31:52.000 --> 00:31:55.000
[thuds]

650
00:31:57.000 --> 00:32:00.000
Woah.

651
00:32:02.000 --> 00:32:05.000
[light music]

652
00:32:08.000 --> 00:32:09.000
-Welcome to the world
-[gasps]

653
00:32:09.000 --> 00:32:12.000
inside the painting.
Scenic isn't it?

654
00:32:12.000 --> 00:32:13.000
What's the big id--

655
00:32:13.000 --> 00:32:15.000
Ah-da-da. Hold onto your socks.

656
00:32:15.000 --> 00:32:18.000
I'm about to show you
a little somethin'.

657
00:32:18.000 --> 00:32:20.000
[Taiyi imitates trumpet]

658
00:32:20.000 --> 00:32:22.000
With one stroke,
you can change the painting

659
00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:26.000
to reflect whatever
your little heart desires!

660
00:32:26.000 --> 00:32:28.000
You've got a brush. Big deal!

661
00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:29.000
Why don't you just sit back

662
00:32:29.000 --> 00:32:32.000
and watch this bad boy
in action!

663
00:32:32.000 --> 00:32:34.000
[Taiyi] Do your thing, brush!

664
00:32:34.000 --> 00:32:37.000
[water sloshing]

665
00:32:38.000 --> 00:32:41.000
[screaming]

666
00:32:42.000 --> 00:32:44.000
[Taiyi chuckling]

667
00:32:44.000 --> 00:32:46.000
[Ne Zha] No, no, no.

668
00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:49.000
-[Taiyi chuckling]
-[Ne Zha screams]

669
00:32:51.000 --> 00:32:54.000
[Taiyi chuckles]

670
00:32:54.000 --> 00:32:57.000
[cheering]

671
00:33:01.000 --> 00:33:04.000
[light music]

672
00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:11.000
[ice crackling]

673
00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:21.000
[Taiyi laughs]

674
00:33:21.000 --> 00:33:24.000
-[cheers]
-[Ne Zha screaming]

675
00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:29.000
[panting, gasps]

676
00:33:29.000 --> 00:33:32.000
[Taiyi chuckling]

677
00:33:35.000 --> 00:33:38.000
Wow!

678
00:33:39.000 --> 00:33:43.000
Young apprentice,
we haven't even started!

679
00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:47.000
[water splashing]

680
00:33:50.000 --> 00:33:53.000
[light music]

681
00:33:57.000 --> 00:34:01.000
Wow...

682
00:34:06.000 --> 00:34:08.000
[Ne Zha laughing]

683
00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:10.000
Mighty impressive, huh?

684
00:34:10.000 --> 00:34:13.000
Just think,
you can spend every day here

685
00:34:13.000 --> 00:34:15.000
learning the Immortal magic
of Kunlun with me.

686
00:34:15.000 --> 00:34:18.000
Go ahead. Call me master,
I know you're impressed.

687
00:34:18.000 --> 00:34:21.000
Master?
[scoffs]

688
00:34:21.000 --> 00:34:23.000
What could I learn from you?

689
00:34:24.000 --> 00:34:28.000
Huh? Why you--
You're in trouble now.

690
00:34:28.000 --> 00:34:30.000
[Taiyi] On my command,
one, two, change!

691
00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:32.000
[zaps]

692
00:34:32.000 --> 00:34:33.000
-[gasps]
-[scissor rasps]

693
00:34:33.000 --> 00:34:35.000
[gasps, grunting]

694
00:34:35.000 --> 00:34:37.000
-Look out.
-[zaps]

695
00:34:38.000 --> 00:34:40.000
-Magic'd!
-[zaps]

696
00:34:40.000 --> 00:34:42.000
-Huh?
-[Taiyi] That's my handy-dandy

697
00:34:42.000 --> 00:34:43.000
disguising spell.

698
00:34:43.000 --> 00:34:45.000
-Wanna learn it?
-Yeah!

699
00:34:45.000 --> 00:34:47.000
This looks yummy.

700
00:34:47.000 --> 00:34:49.000
-[munches]
-[puffs]

701
00:34:49.000 --> 00:34:53.000
-[coughing]
-[laughing]

702
00:34:54.000 --> 00:34:56.000
So can you make me
look all big and scary?

703
00:34:56.000 --> 00:34:58.000
Now what would I go
and do all that for?

704
00:34:58.000 --> 00:35:01.000
Also, that's next-level stuff,
even I can't pull that off.

705
00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:02.000
Don't get fancy,
learn the basics.

706
00:35:02.000 --> 00:35:04.000
Come on little guy.

707
00:35:04.000 --> 00:35:05.000
Your master's gonna teach you...

708
00:35:05.000 --> 00:35:08.000
[indistinct whispering]

709
00:35:08.000 --> 00:35:11.000
That's easy.
Teach me something cooler.

710
00:35:11.000 --> 00:35:13.000
The disguising spell
is the most basic.

711
00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:16.000
If you won't learn that
then I won't even bother!

712
00:35:16.000 --> 00:35:20.000
Fine. Watch me knock this out.

713
00:35:20.000 --> 00:35:23.000
On my command! Change!

714
00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:25.000
Change!

715
00:35:25.000 --> 00:35:26.000
-Change!
-[chuckles]

716
00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:29.000
The disguising spell
isn't even remotely basic.

717
00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:33.000
Took me six whole months
to master my first disguise.

718
00:35:33.000 --> 00:35:36.000
Knock yourself out,
take your time.

719
00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:40.000
AN IMMORTAL PREPARES

720
00:35:43.000 --> 00:35:46.000
[snoring]

721
00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:50.000
[Lady Yin] Master? Master.

722
00:35:50.000 --> 00:35:54.000
[groans]

723
00:35:54.000 --> 00:35:56.000
[blabbers]
Lady Yin. What a nice surprise.

724
00:35:56.000 --> 00:35:58.000
I'm checking on Ne Zha.

725
00:35:58.000 --> 00:36:00.000
I'm just teaching him
some stuff.

726
00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.000
Where is my son?

727
00:36:01.000 --> 00:36:04.000
Oh, right there...

728
00:36:04.000 --> 00:36:06.000
Huh?

729
00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:09.000
Hang on. What is that?

730
00:36:10.000 --> 00:36:12.000
Ah! Hang on, kid.

731
00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:14.000
I'll save you.

732
00:36:17.000 --> 00:36:19.000
[groans]

733
00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:23.000
[grunting]

734
00:36:26.000 --> 00:36:29.000
Ne Zha. What happened?

735
00:36:29.000 --> 00:36:31.000
What is this?

736
00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:33.000
Huh? I didn't do that!
I promise you!

737
00:36:33.000 --> 00:36:35.000
How'd this happen?

738
00:36:35.000 --> 00:36:37.000
Oh, good, he has a pulse.

739
00:36:37.000 --> 00:36:40.000
[grunting]

740
00:36:40.000 --> 00:36:43.000
[blows air]

741
00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:52.000
[groans]

742
00:36:53.000 --> 00:36:56.000
Oh! Oh, no! It's poisonous.

743
00:36:56.000 --> 00:36:58.000
[blabbering]

744
00:37:08.000 --> 00:37:11.000
You should treat me
with more respect.

745
00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:13.000
How'd you master that spell
so quickly?

746
00:37:13.000 --> 00:37:15.000
I don't know,
by being super awesome?

747
00:37:15.000 --> 00:37:17.000
Okay, don't get jealous.

748
00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:20.000
Even though it took him one day
what took you six months.

749
00:37:20.000 --> 00:37:22.000
[laughing]
Share your trick

750
00:37:22.000 --> 00:37:24.000
with your beloved master?

751
00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:27.000
Teach me more Immortal Magic
and I'll tell you.

752
00:37:27.000 --> 00:37:28.000
Yep! You got it, kid!

753
00:37:28.000 --> 00:37:31.000
Since your element is fire,
I'll teach you fire control.

754
00:37:31.000 --> 00:37:33.000
Tongue of flame. Sands of time.

755
00:37:33.000 --> 00:37:35.000
Unleash heat
from the holy shrine.

756
00:37:35.000 --> 00:37:36.000
Make it so!

757
00:37:36.000 --> 00:37:40.000
[grunting]

758
00:37:41.000 --> 00:37:43.000
[groans]
Not cool, that got in my eye.

759
00:37:43.000 --> 00:37:46.000
I can't say this spell right
with my tongue all swollen.

760
00:37:46.000 --> 00:37:51.000
Aha! Good thing I have
an anti-venom pill in my pants.

761
00:37:53.000 --> 00:37:54.000
Oh, I can't reach it.

762
00:37:54.000 --> 00:37:57.000
Can you get it for me,
little guy, please?

763
00:37:57.000 --> 00:37:59.000
No problem.

764
00:37:59.000 --> 00:38:03.000
Whoa! You've got
like treasure pants!

765
00:38:03.000 --> 00:38:05.000
[Ne Zha] Huh? What's this
weird moppy thingy?

766
00:38:05.000 --> 00:38:08.000
It's for flies.

767
00:38:08.000 --> 00:38:11.000
[Ne Zha] What?
What about this shiny thing?

768
00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:12.000
That's a fire-tipped spear.

769
00:38:12.000 --> 00:38:15.000
[Ne Zha] A fire-tipped spear,
huh?

770
00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:17.000
Hey, don't touch that switch.

771
00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:18.000
-You mean this switch?
-[clicking]

772
00:38:18.000 --> 00:38:21.000
[flames roar]

773
00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:25.000
Huh? Ha?

774
00:38:27.000 --> 00:38:30.000
[screaming]

775
00:38:32.000 --> 00:38:36.000
Ne Zha!
Are you causing trouble again?

776
00:38:38.000 --> 00:38:41.000
[panting]

777
00:38:41.000 --> 00:38:43.000
-Your grace! Are you all right?
-[Taiyi sighs deeply]

778
00:38:43.000 --> 00:38:47.000
I'm an immortal,
I can't get hurt, but thanks.

779
00:38:47.000 --> 00:38:49.000
Ne Zha. If you show me respect,

780
00:38:49.000 --> 00:38:51.000
the things I'll teach you...

781
00:38:51.000 --> 00:38:53.000
Like banishing demons
and defeating monsters.

782
00:38:53.000 --> 00:38:56.000
What? Banish demons?
And defeat monsters?

783
00:38:56.000 --> 00:39:00.000
Nice try! Like I'd ever
learn anything from you.

784
00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:01.000
How do I get out of here?

785
00:39:01.000 --> 00:39:03.000
Well you'll have to use
this little landscape brush,

786
00:39:03.000 --> 00:39:06.000
if you wish to escape
from the painting.

787
00:39:06.000 --> 00:39:07.000
Oh, wait a minute.

788
00:39:07.000 --> 00:39:09.000
You want to keep me
locked up in here.

789
00:39:09.000 --> 00:39:11.000
No don't be silly.

790
00:39:11.000 --> 00:39:13.000
A place this lovely
could never be a prison, dear.

791
00:39:13.000 --> 00:39:15.000
It's a "training retreat."

792
00:39:15.000 --> 00:39:18.000
So I train
and they'd still hate me anyway.

793
00:39:18.000 --> 00:39:21.000
I'd be better off
just taking a nap.

794
00:39:21.000 --> 00:39:25.000
[Lady Yin] Ne Zha.
I'm your mother.

795
00:39:25.000 --> 00:39:29.000
I know you. I know you want
the others to accept you.

796
00:39:29.000 --> 00:39:32.000
But you feel more and more alone
every time they rejected you.

797
00:39:32.000 --> 00:39:34.000
And you resent them for that.

798
00:39:34.000 --> 00:39:37.000
[scoffs]

799
00:39:37.000 --> 00:39:39.000
Young master?

800
00:39:39.000 --> 00:39:44.000
How did he get out again?
Young master?

801
00:39:44.000 --> 00:39:47.000
[giggling]
Huh?

802
00:39:50.000 --> 00:39:53.000
Hi, you wanna play?

803
00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:55.000
Mm-hm!

804
00:39:55.000 --> 00:39:56.000
[both giggle]

805
00:39:56.000 --> 00:39:58.000
[shrieks]
Ne Zha!

806
00:39:58.000 --> 00:40:00.000
I thought he was locked away!

807
00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:03.000
-They let him out!
-Everyone run!

808
00:40:03.000 --> 00:40:07.000
[crowd clamoring]

809
00:40:08.000 --> 00:40:11.000
[whimpers]

810
00:40:13.000 --> 00:40:15.000
Go back to where you came from!

811
00:40:15.000 --> 00:40:16.000
-Yeah!
-Little demon brat!

812
00:40:16.000 --> 00:40:18.000
-No one likes you!
-You're a Demon!

813
00:40:18.000 --> 00:40:20.000
Yeah, no one wants you here!

814
00:40:20.000 --> 00:40:22.000
Go away!

815
00:40:26.000 --> 00:40:28.000
You've been through a lot,
but it will be alright.

816
00:40:28.000 --> 00:40:32.000
After your training you'll
be able to banish demons

817
00:40:32.000 --> 00:40:34.000
with us and earn
their admiration.

818
00:40:34.000 --> 00:40:37.000
Why would I do anything
for them? Never!

819
00:40:37.000 --> 00:40:38.000
They wanna see me as a demon?

820
00:40:38.000 --> 00:40:41.000
I'll show them what a demon
really looks like!

821
00:40:42.000 --> 00:40:43.000
Dear, you...

822
00:40:43.000 --> 00:40:45.000
[sighs]

823
00:40:45.000 --> 00:40:49.000
I guess it's time
we tell you the truth.

824
00:40:49.000 --> 00:40:53.000
The secret we've kept
for so long.

825
00:40:53.000 --> 00:40:55.000
Why they're so afraid.

826
00:40:55.000 --> 00:40:58.000
-[gasps]
-You are actually...

827
00:40:58.000 --> 00:41:01.000
The Spirit, what?

828
00:41:01.000 --> 00:41:03.000
[inhales deeply]
Oh. right, right. right!

829
00:41:03.000 --> 00:41:04.000
The reincarnation!

830
00:41:04.000 --> 00:41:08.000
And it's that divine strength
they find so intimidating.

831
00:41:08.000 --> 00:41:10.000
Are you... lying?

832
00:41:10.000 --> 00:41:13.000
[scoffs]
Use your head.

833
00:41:13.000 --> 00:41:15.000
Your father and I are humans.

834
00:41:15.000 --> 00:41:17.000
How could we give birth
to a demon?

835
00:41:17.000 --> 00:41:20.000
Then, why don't you just
tell them I'm the Spirit Pearl?

836
00:41:20.000 --> 00:41:22.000
The Spirit Pearl
was a secret weapon

837
00:41:22.000 --> 00:41:24.000
the Supreme Lord sent down
to the mortal realm.

838
00:41:24.000 --> 00:41:27.000
It's not called an "everyone
knows about it" weapon.

839
00:41:27.000 --> 00:41:30.000
[Taiyi] They couldn't
handle the truth.

840
00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:33.000
The truth...

841
00:41:33.000 --> 00:41:35.000
In the meantime,
try to win their hearts.

842
00:41:35.000 --> 00:41:36.000
Treat them as if they're family.

843
00:41:36.000 --> 00:41:38.000
Keep them safe from harm,

844
00:41:38.000 --> 00:41:40.000
and they'll surely
return the favor,

845
00:41:40.000 --> 00:41:43.000
embracing you
as one of their own.

846
00:41:48.000 --> 00:41:51.000
TWO YEARS LATER

847
00:41:52.000 --> 00:41:54.000
[roaring]

848
00:41:54.000 --> 00:41:56.000
[clicking]

849
00:41:56.000 --> 00:41:59.000
-[demon growls]
-[crowd clamoring]

850
00:41:59.000 --> 00:42:01.000
[thuds]

851
00:42:09.000 --> 00:42:11.000
Total piece of cake.

852
00:42:11.000 --> 00:42:14.000
[whistling]

853
00:42:16.000 --> 00:42:20.000
[Taiyi] No, no, no.
Way too impulsive.

854
00:42:25.000 --> 00:42:27.000
Show him, go on.

855
00:42:31.000 --> 00:42:34.000
-[sneezes]
-[grunts]

856
00:42:40.000 --> 00:42:44.000
[whirring]

857
00:42:47.000 --> 00:42:48.000
[whirring continues]

858
00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:50.000
Stop there.

859
00:42:50.000 --> 00:42:52.000
Yummy human!

860
00:42:52.000 --> 00:42:55.000
[skeleton screams]

861
00:42:55.000 --> 00:42:57.000
[Taiyi] See here?

862
00:42:59.000 --> 00:43:01.000
[people screaming]

863
00:43:01.000 --> 00:43:02.000
[rumbling]

864
00:43:02.000 --> 00:43:04.000
[Taiyi] And here too.

865
00:43:06.000 --> 00:43:07.000
[grunts]

866
00:43:07.000 --> 00:43:09.000
-[explosion]
-[people screaming]

867
00:43:09.000 --> 00:43:11.000
Look at that. You harmed
all those innocent civilians,

868
00:43:11.000 --> 00:43:13.000
just to destroy
a couple skeletons.

869
00:43:13.000 --> 00:43:15.000
Yeah, they're
not even real though.

870
00:43:15.000 --> 00:43:16.000
What's the big deal.

871
00:43:16.000 --> 00:43:18.000
If you can't do the right thing
in training,

872
00:43:18.000 --> 00:43:21.000
how can we trust you
in the real world.

873
00:43:21.000 --> 00:43:24.000
Your Grace, take away
his Chaotic Silk and spear.

874
00:43:24.000 --> 00:43:26.000
[Li Jing]
Until he learns self-control,

875
00:43:26.000 --> 00:43:27.000
he's banned from
such powerful weapons.

876
00:43:27.000 --> 00:43:30.000
Fine, so take it back.
See if I care!

877
00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:32.000
I've learned
all your Immortal Magic,

878
00:43:32.000 --> 00:43:33.000
so I can go kick demon butt.

879
00:43:33.000 --> 00:43:35.000
No way.

880
00:43:35.000 --> 00:43:37.000
In fact, from now on
your only focus

881
00:43:37.000 --> 00:43:39.000
will be meditation not fighting.

882
00:43:39.000 --> 00:43:41.000
What? You wanted me to learn
how to fight monsters.

883
00:43:41.000 --> 00:43:43.000
Well I did that!

884
00:43:43.000 --> 00:43:45.000
Oh, why won't you
let me out of here?

885
00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:48.000
You're not leaving here
'til I say so.

886
00:43:50.000 --> 00:43:51.000
[scoffs]
Yeah, whatever.

887
00:43:51.000 --> 00:43:53.000
I'd like to see you
try and stop me.

888
00:43:53.000 --> 00:43:56.000
-Huh, how'd he get that?
-Ne Zha!

889
00:43:56.000 --> 00:43:57.000
[Ne Zha]
Don't worry, I got this!

890
00:43:57.000 --> 00:44:00.000
They're gonna love me!

891
00:44:01.000 --> 00:44:03.000
[clatters]

892
00:44:05.000 --> 00:44:08.000
[suspenseful music]

893
00:44:15.000 --> 00:44:18.000
-[splashing]
-[fishermen grunt]

894
00:44:22.000 --> 00:44:25.000
[suspenseful music]

895
00:44:31.000 --> 00:44:34.000
[sloshing]

896
00:44:34.000 --> 00:44:37.000
[dog pants]

897
00:44:39.000 --> 00:44:42.000
[whimpers]

898
00:44:43.000 --> 00:44:45.000
I'm so sick of seafood.

899
00:44:45.000 --> 00:44:47.000
But it's good
to change things up.

900
00:44:47.000 --> 00:44:50.000
-[chuckles]
-[dog whimpering]

901
00:44:50.000 --> 00:44:51.000
-[roars]
-[Ne Zha] Yo, demon!

902
00:44:51.000 --> 00:44:53.000
Let go of that dog!

903
00:44:53.000 --> 00:44:54.000
-Huh?
-[dog whimpering]

904
00:44:54.000 --> 00:44:56.000
-Huh?
-[chuckling]

905
00:44:56.000 --> 00:44:59.000
[laughing]

906
00:44:59.000 --> 00:45:01.000
What, you want me
to eat you instead?

907
00:45:01.000 --> 00:45:04.000
Right here!

908
00:45:05.000 --> 00:45:08.000
[groans]
Why...

909
00:45:10.000 --> 00:45:11.000
-[distant thud]
-[all] Huh?

910
00:45:11.000 --> 00:45:13.000
-Huh?
-Huh?

911
00:45:17.000 --> 00:45:20.000
[laughing]

912
00:45:22.000 --> 00:45:25.000
Oh, no, you don't!

913
00:45:29.000 --> 00:45:32.000
[water sloshing]

914
00:45:35.000 --> 00:45:39.000
[upbeat music]

915
00:45:40.000 --> 00:45:43.000
[splashing]

916
00:45:45.000 --> 00:45:48.000
-Huh?
-[water splashes]

917
00:45:48.000 --> 00:45:49.000
[Ne Zha] Get out here!

918
00:45:49.000 --> 00:45:52.000
-Show your face!
-[crowd murmuring]

919
00:45:52.000 --> 00:45:54.000
-[growls]
-[crowd gasps, screams]

920
00:45:54.000 --> 00:45:56.000
[Ne Zha] Stop!

921
00:45:56.000 --> 00:45:57.000
Turn around and watch this!

922
00:45:57.000 --> 00:45:59.000
[shatters]

923
00:45:59.000 --> 00:46:02.000
Come out! Stop hiding!

924
00:46:02.000 --> 00:46:04.000
-[Ne Zha grunting]
-[crowd gasp]

925
00:46:04.000 --> 00:46:06.000
[scoffs]
Be like that.

926
00:46:06.000 --> 00:46:08.000
Guess I'll have
to smoke you out!

927
00:46:08.000 --> 00:46:11.000
[screaming]

928
00:46:12.000 --> 00:46:14.000
[crowd gasp, clamor]

929
00:46:14.000 --> 00:46:17.000
-How horrible!
-Ne Zha's gone mad!

930
00:46:18.000 --> 00:46:22.000
-[shattering]
-[crowd screaming]

931
00:46:23.000 --> 00:46:26.000
[Ne Zha] Hey!
Where you think you're goin'?

932
00:46:31.000 --> 00:46:34.000
[upbeat music]

933
00:46:35.000 --> 00:46:37.000
Ready? It's coming!

934
00:46:37.000 --> 00:46:39.000
[groans]

935
00:46:40.000 --> 00:46:42.000
-[rumbles]
-[both] Huh?

936
00:46:44.000 --> 00:46:46.000
-[screams]
-[gasps]

937
00:46:46.000 --> 00:46:49.000
[water sloshes]

938
00:46:51.000 --> 00:46:54.000
[sloshing continues]

939
00:46:57.000 --> 00:46:58.000
[gasps]

940
00:46:58.000 --> 00:47:01.000
Ne Zha kidnapped Yaya!

941
00:47:02.000 --> 00:47:06.000
Good luck catching me
in the sea, puny human!

942
00:47:06.000 --> 00:47:08.000
[chuckles, blows raspberries]

943
00:47:08.000 --> 00:47:09.000
[growls]

944
00:47:09.000 --> 00:47:12.000
[ice crackles]

945
00:47:12.000 --> 00:47:14.000
[whimpers]

946
00:47:14.000 --> 00:47:16.000
[Ao Bing] I've frozen the sea
for half a kilometer.

947
00:47:16.000 --> 00:47:19.000
You can't escape.

948
00:47:21.000 --> 00:47:24.000
Demon, let the girl go.

949
00:47:24.000 --> 00:47:26.000
Why should I listen to you?

950
00:47:26.000 --> 00:47:29.000
Stay back, child.
I'm here to save her.

951
00:47:29.000 --> 00:47:31.000
I'm not a child!

952
00:47:31.000 --> 00:47:33.000
[Ao Bing] You should surrender.

953
00:47:35.000 --> 00:47:36.000
[roars]

954
00:47:36.000 --> 00:47:39.000
[thudding]

955
00:47:43.000 --> 00:47:46.000
[groaning]

956
00:47:46.000 --> 00:47:47.000
Wrong choice.

957
00:47:47.000 --> 00:47:50.000
[chiming]

958
00:47:50.000 --> 00:47:51.000
[Yaya groans]

959
00:47:51.000 --> 00:47:53.000
Back off
and get in line, weirdo!

960
00:47:53.000 --> 00:47:54.000
I saw this guy first!

961
00:47:54.000 --> 00:47:57.000
What-- what on earth
are you doing?

962
00:47:57.000 --> 00:47:59.000
-[Yaya grunts]
-Huh?

963
00:47:59.000 --> 00:48:01.000
Wait your turn!
I'll kick your butt next!

964
00:48:01.000 --> 00:48:04.000
Where are you paren--
[grunts]

965
00:48:04.000 --> 00:48:07.000
[groans]

966
00:48:07.000 --> 00:48:10.000
Town's only big enough
for one cool guy.

967
00:48:11.000 --> 00:48:14.000
-Hey, demon! Let that girl go!
-Huh?

968
00:48:16.000 --> 00:48:18.000
There's something
different about you.

969
00:48:18.000 --> 00:48:20.000
Whatever!

970
00:48:21.000 --> 00:48:24.000
-[thuds]
-[rumbles]

971
00:48:31.000 --> 00:48:32.000
-[munches]
-[gasps]

972
00:48:32.000 --> 00:48:35.000
Ow, let go! I said let go!

973
00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:38.000
[cloak rasps]

974
00:48:38.000 --> 00:48:40.000
[laughing]

975
00:48:40.000 --> 00:48:42.000
Huh? Woah, you have horns!

976
00:48:42.000 --> 00:48:45.000
Huh.
[sighs]

977
00:48:45.000 --> 00:48:48.000
[grunting]

978
00:48:52.000 --> 00:48:55.000
[laughing]

979
00:48:56.000 --> 00:48:59.000
[blows air]

980
00:49:01.000 --> 00:49:04.000
[suspenseful music]

981
00:49:04.000 --> 00:49:07.000
[groans]

982
00:49:12.000 --> 00:49:15.000
Huh, bubbles?

983
00:49:16.000 --> 00:49:18.000
[gasps]
What's goin' on?

984
00:49:18.000 --> 00:49:21.000
[laughing]
Take a good look around you.

985
00:49:21.000 --> 00:49:24.000
I should thank you both
for giving me time

986
00:49:24.000 --> 00:49:26.000
to unleash my special attack.

987
00:49:26.000 --> 00:49:28.000
[Sea Yaksha] Go on, make a move.

988
00:49:28.000 --> 00:49:29.000
Not so tough now, huh?

989
00:49:29.000 --> 00:49:31.000
I can finally have my dinner
in peace.

990
00:49:31.000 --> 00:49:33.000
-[Yaya yelps]
-[gulping]

991
00:49:33.000 --> 00:49:36.000
-[laughs]
-Hey, spit her out!

992
00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:39.000
When I get done with you,
you'll wish that you--

993
00:49:39.000 --> 00:49:43.000
[whooshing]

994
00:49:44.000 --> 00:49:46.000
[grunts]

995
00:49:48.000 --> 00:49:49.000
[Sea Yaksha retches, chuckles]

996
00:49:49.000 --> 00:49:51.000
You don't look so good.

997
00:49:51.000 --> 00:49:53.000
Uh-oh, my spit gotcha!

998
00:49:53.000 --> 00:49:57.000
Seems like you hit
"rock bottom".

999
00:49:58.000 --> 00:50:00.000
Maybe in your next life

1000
00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:03.000
you'll learn
to mind your own business.

1001
00:50:03.000 --> 00:50:06.000
[screams]

1002
00:50:06.000 --> 00:50:08.000
-[grunting]
-[bubbles popping]

1003
00:50:08.000 --> 00:50:11.000
Huh?
[grunts]

1004
00:50:11.000 --> 00:50:13.000
[gasps]

1005
00:50:14.000 --> 00:50:17.000
[blowing air]

1006
00:50:19.000 --> 00:50:22.000
[blowing continues]

1007
00:50:24.000 --> 00:50:27.000
[laughing]
Bring it on, kid!

1008
00:50:31.000 --> 00:50:35.000
[whooshing]

1009
00:50:37.000 --> 00:50:39.000
-[whooshing continues]
-[Ne Zha laughs]

1010
00:50:39.000 --> 00:50:41.000
[inhales deeply]

1011
00:50:45.000 --> 00:50:47.000
-[thuds]
-[screams]

1012
00:50:48.000 --> 00:50:51.000
[groaning]

1013
00:50:53.000 --> 00:50:54.000
Please have mercy!

1014
00:50:54.000 --> 00:50:56.000
I'll give you the antidote!

1015
00:50:56.000 --> 00:50:59.000
Antidote?

1016
00:50:59.000 --> 00:51:02.000
[snorting]

1017
00:51:03.000 --> 00:51:06.000
Don't worry. It's enough.

1018
00:51:06.000 --> 00:51:08.000
[bubble pops]

1019
00:51:08.000 --> 00:51:11.000
[groans]

1020
00:51:15.000 --> 00:51:18.000
[retches]
It tastes like garlic!

1021
00:51:19.000 --> 00:51:22.000
Huh? Look at that!
[chuckles]

1022
00:51:22.000 --> 00:51:24.000
How'll they drink?
Their mouths can't move!

1023
00:51:24.000 --> 00:51:27.000
Uh, you can also apply it
to the skin.

1024
00:51:27.000 --> 00:51:30.000
-[chuckles]
-[gasps]

1025
00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:33.000
Why didn't you say so?

1026
00:51:33.000 --> 00:51:37.000
Well, because you didn't ask.
[chuckles]

1027
00:51:38.000 --> 00:51:41.000
[Sea Yaksha] That's right,
spread it evenly.

1028
00:51:41.000 --> 00:51:44.000
You have to
really massage it in.

1029
00:51:44.000 --> 00:51:46.000
The skin'll absorb it faster.

1030
00:51:46.000 --> 00:51:50.000
Plus, it makes the complexion
all dewy!

1031
00:51:51.000 --> 00:51:54.000
[light music]

1032
00:52:02.000 --> 00:52:05.000
[footsteps rustling]

1033
00:52:10.000 --> 00:52:12.000
[sniffs, groans]

1034
00:52:12.000 --> 00:52:14.000
-[Ao Bing] Wait.
-Huh?

1035
00:52:14.000 --> 00:52:15.000
[grunts]
Spare me.

1036
00:52:15.000 --> 00:52:17.000
I just wanted a snack.

1037
00:52:17.000 --> 00:52:19.000
I didn't eat a person.

1038
00:52:19.000 --> 00:52:22.000
You gave us the antidote.
So I'm grateful.

1039
00:52:22.000 --> 00:52:24.000
But if you try to do evil
in the future,

1040
00:52:24.000 --> 00:52:26.000
I won't spare you again.

1041
00:52:26.000 --> 00:52:29.000
[chuckles]
Okay, okay.

1042
00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:31.000
Hey, you! Boy!

1043
00:52:31.000 --> 00:52:33.000
What? Still wanna fight?

1044
00:52:33.000 --> 00:52:34.000
That's not fair to you.

1045
00:52:34.000 --> 00:52:36.000
Huh? I'm no match for you?

1046
00:52:36.000 --> 00:52:38.000
Come on then.
Show me what you got.

1047
00:52:38.000 --> 00:52:40.000
-Thank you for saving me.
-Huh?

1048
00:52:40.000 --> 00:52:42.000
[Ao Bing] And for saving
this girl as well.

1049
00:52:42.000 --> 00:52:44.000
Today you were my ally.

1050
00:52:44.000 --> 00:52:47.000
I will find a way to repay
the kindness you've shown.

1051
00:52:47.000 --> 00:52:49.000
[chuckles]
Nah, it was nothin'.

1052
00:52:49.000 --> 00:52:51.000
I was simply following
the will of Heaven.

1053
00:52:51.000 --> 00:52:55.000
Cause I was destined
to be a great demon slayer!

1054
00:52:55.000 --> 00:52:58.000
[giggling]

1055
00:52:58.000 --> 00:53:01.000
You're not afraid of me?

1056
00:53:01.000 --> 00:53:05.000
You save Yaya from bad guy.

1057
00:53:06.000 --> 00:53:08.000
[both laugh]

1058
00:53:08.000 --> 00:53:11.000
[giggling]

1059
00:53:16.000 --> 00:53:19.000
[Yaya gasps, laughs]

1060
00:53:22.000 --> 00:53:25.000
[whooshing]

1061
00:53:28.000 --> 00:53:31.000
[calm music]

1062
00:53:31.000 --> 00:53:34.000
Hm. Huh?

1063
00:53:48.000 --> 00:53:52.000
[whooshing]

1064
00:54:04.000 --> 00:54:07.000
[calm music]

1065
00:54:18.000 --> 00:54:20.000
Hey. What's wrong?

1066
00:54:20.000 --> 00:54:23.000
It's nothing.
Just got eyes in my sand.

1067
00:54:23.000 --> 00:54:25.000
[Ao Bing] You mean sand
in your eyes?

1068
00:54:25.000 --> 00:54:29.000
Let me see.
I can get it out for you.

1069
00:54:31.000 --> 00:54:35.000
Aw man! This is so embarrassing!

1070
00:54:35.000 --> 00:54:37.000
Okay, fine!

1071
00:54:37.000 --> 00:54:39.000
My mom's the only other person
who'll play this with me.

1072
00:54:39.000 --> 00:54:42.000
So I got emotional. Big deal!

1073
00:54:42.000 --> 00:54:44.000
[grunts]

1074
00:54:46.000 --> 00:54:47.000
Huh?

1075
00:54:47.000 --> 00:54:50.000
We're friends now.

1076
00:54:50.000 --> 00:54:52.000
If you want to play again,
come to the shore and blow this.

1077
00:54:52.000 --> 00:54:55.000
When I hear the conch shell,
I'll come from wherever I am.

1078
00:54:55.000 --> 00:54:57.000
I forgot. I'm Ao Bing.

1079
00:54:57.000 --> 00:54:58.000
And you?

1080
00:54:58.000 --> 00:55:01.000
My name's Ne Zha!

1081
00:55:01.000 --> 00:55:03.000
Your friends?

1082
00:55:03.000 --> 00:55:04.000
-What?
-[crowd murmuring]

1083
00:55:04.000 --> 00:55:06.000
[clamoring]

1084
00:55:06.000 --> 00:55:08.000
-There she is!
-He's here!

1085
00:55:09.000 --> 00:55:11.000
Huh?

1086
00:55:14.000 --> 00:55:16.000
[crowd panting]

1087
00:55:16.000 --> 00:55:18.000
There's Ne Zha.
He kidnapped Yaya!

1088
00:55:18.000 --> 00:55:19.000
The demon!

1089
00:55:19.000 --> 00:55:21.000
My baby! Oh, Yaya!

1090
00:55:21.000 --> 00:55:22.000
Yaya! How are you feeling?

1091
00:55:22.000 --> 00:55:25.000
Ne Zha hit. Pow, pow, pow!

1092
00:55:25.000 --> 00:55:27.000
Demon go, boom, boom!

1093
00:55:27.000 --> 00:55:29.000
Why would you kidnap
a little girl!?

1094
00:55:29.000 --> 00:55:30.000
That's not what happened!

1095
00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:32.000
If I hadn't
chased that thing down,

1096
00:55:32.000 --> 00:55:33.000
she would've been
demon-food already.

1097
00:55:33.000 --> 00:55:36.000
So where's the demon then?
Did you see one?

1098
00:55:36.000 --> 00:55:37.000
How about you?

1099
00:55:37.000 --> 00:55:38.000
Do you seriously think
we're that dumb?

1100
00:55:38.000 --> 00:55:39.000
-Yeah?
-Yeah!

1101
00:55:39.000 --> 00:55:42.000
You won't get away with this!

1102
00:55:44.000 --> 00:55:48.000
-[crowd clamoring]
-Okay, I see.

1103
00:55:50.000 --> 00:55:53.000
Go away, you demon brat!

1104
00:55:56.000 --> 00:55:58.000
[whooshes]

1105
00:55:58.000 --> 00:56:00.000
You wanna say that again?

1106
00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:03.000
[gasps]
Stop it!

1107
00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:05.000
-[grunts]
-[thumps]

1108
00:56:09.000 --> 00:56:12.000
-[all gasp]
-See? He's a monster!

1109
00:56:12.000 --> 00:56:15.000
-We'll kill you!
-Die, demon!

1110
00:56:17.000 --> 00:56:20.000
-[thumping, thudding]
-[crowd screaming]

1111
00:56:21.000 --> 00:56:23.000
[all gasp]

1112
00:56:27.000 --> 00:56:29.000
[grunts]

1113
00:56:33.000 --> 00:56:36.000
[thuds, groans]

1114
00:56:39.000 --> 00:56:42.000
[Ne Zha screams]

1115
00:56:43.000 --> 00:56:45.000
Your master has arrived.

1116
00:56:45.000 --> 00:56:46.000
Stop hurting people.

1117
00:56:46.000 --> 00:56:48.000
[whooshing]

1118
00:56:49.000 --> 00:56:50.000
[yelps, screams]

1119
00:56:50.000 --> 00:56:53.000
-[Lady Yin] Ne Zha.
-[growls]

1120
00:56:54.000 --> 00:56:55.000
[Old Man] Commander Li!

1121
00:56:55.000 --> 00:56:58.000
Ne Zha burned down the village,
kidnapped a child,

1122
00:56:58.000 --> 00:57:00.000
and attacked the villagers.

1123
00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:02.000
-We demand he be punished.
-[crowd chatter]

1124
00:57:02.000 --> 00:57:06.000
My crimes? I'm gonna show you
a real crime!

1125
00:57:06.000 --> 00:57:08.000
-[Ne Zha grunts]
-[Lady Yin] Ne Zha, don't.

1126
00:57:09.000 --> 00:57:10.000
[whooshes]

1127
00:57:10.000 --> 00:57:13.000
[Ne Zha grunting]

1128
00:57:17.000 --> 00:57:21.000
Lord Li, you must lock
this demon-child up.

1129
00:57:21.000 --> 00:57:23.000
Never again to see
the light of day.

1130
00:57:23.000 --> 00:57:25.000
Lock him up!
And throw away the key!

1131
00:57:25.000 --> 00:57:27.000
-[crowd cheer]
-Lord Li,

1132
00:57:27.000 --> 00:57:29.000
you must get your son
under control!

1133
00:57:29.000 --> 00:57:31.000
We'd thank you!

1134
00:57:31.000 --> 00:57:34.000
[crowd clamoring]

1135
00:57:34.000 --> 00:57:36.000
[villager]
He's destroying everything!

1136
00:57:36.000 --> 00:57:38.000
It's not safe!

1137
00:57:41.000 --> 00:57:44.000
[crowd jeering]

1138
00:57:47.000 --> 00:57:50.000
Father... Master.

1139
00:57:50.000 --> 00:57:53.000
How did today's assignment go?

1140
00:57:53.000 --> 00:57:56.000
I made seven lesser revolutions
and four greater ones.

1141
00:57:56.000 --> 00:57:59.000
I learned to ice over rivers
and create frost and snow.

1142
00:57:59.000 --> 00:58:03.000
I've reached the seventh heaven
of the Ice Jade.

1143
00:58:03.000 --> 00:58:05.000
Also... I made a friend.

1144
00:58:05.000 --> 00:58:07.000
I met him near the seashore.

1145
00:58:07.000 --> 00:58:09.000
Wha-- what do you mean a friend?

1146
00:58:09.000 --> 00:58:12.000
[stutters]
You can't reveal your identity.

1147
00:58:12.000 --> 00:58:14.000
He was a human,
but he didn't care what I was.

1148
00:58:14.000 --> 00:58:17.000
-Because I'm his friend.
-And who was this person?

1149
00:58:17.000 --> 00:58:19.000
His name was... Ne Zha.

1150
00:58:19.000 --> 00:58:22.000
-Huh?
-[growls]

1151
00:58:22.000 --> 00:58:27.000
[chuckles]
Sma-- small world, apprentice.

1152
00:58:27.000 --> 00:58:29.000
Sounds like you just met
the Demon Pill.

1153
00:58:29.000 --> 00:58:31.000
-Oh, no.
-Ne Zha...

1154
00:58:31.000 --> 00:58:34.000
-is your sworn rival.
-[gasps]

1155
00:58:34.000 --> 00:58:36.000
[Shen] We've waited
three whole years.

1156
00:58:36.000 --> 00:58:38.000
On the day the reckoning occurs,

1157
00:58:38.000 --> 00:58:41.000
the Demon Pill will begin
a mama-- massacre...

1158
00:58:41.000 --> 00:58:43.000
and then you will rescue
Chentang Pass

1159
00:58:43.000 --> 00:58:48.000
and claim your birthright
as the Spirit Pearl.

1160
00:58:48.000 --> 00:58:51.000
Master, might he be granted
redemption?

1161
00:58:51.000 --> 00:58:52.000
[panting]

1162
00:58:52.000 --> 00:58:55.000
In the times of antiquity,

1163
00:58:55.000 --> 00:58:58.000
we dragons
were all-powerful beings,

1164
00:58:58.000 --> 00:59:00.000
revered and worshipped.

1165
00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:04.000
On behalf of Heaven,
we fought monsters,

1166
00:59:04.000 --> 00:59:06.000
subduing them in the ocean,

1167
00:59:06.000 --> 00:59:09.000
earning us
the title of Dragon Kings.

1168
00:59:09.000 --> 00:59:11.000
Do you understand

1169
00:59:11.000 --> 00:59:13.000
what this place really is?

1170
00:59:13.000 --> 00:59:15.000
Our Palace, right?

1171
00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:18.000
Beneath the magma
of this volcano

1172
00:59:18.000 --> 00:59:22.000
are the countless creatures
we defeated those many years ago

1173
00:59:22.000 --> 00:59:26.000
at the request
of the Supreme Lord.

1174
00:59:27.000 --> 00:59:30.000
[Dragon King] "Dragon Palace"?

1175
00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:31.000
[laughs]

1176
00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:36.000
It's as much our prison
as it is theirs.

1177
00:59:36.000 --> 00:59:37.000
[hisses]

1178
00:59:37.000 --> 00:59:40.000
If we were to leave this place,

1179
00:59:40.000 --> 00:59:44.000
the monsters would break free of
their imprisonment and escape.

1180
00:59:44.000 --> 00:59:46.000
Do you see now, son?

1181
00:59:46.000 --> 00:59:51.000
They tricked us into
doing their dirty work for them.

1182
00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:53.000
After all.

1183
00:59:53.000 --> 00:59:54.000
What were we to Heaven

1184
00:59:54.000 --> 00:59:59.000
other than just monsters
to be locked away.

1185
00:59:59.000 --> 01:00:02.000
The title "King" they gave us?

1186
01:00:02.000 --> 01:00:06.000
It's laughable.
I am nothing more than

1187
01:00:06.000 --> 01:00:08.000
another prisoner in this pit.

1188
01:00:08.000 --> 01:00:13.000
We sealed our fate the moment
we took them at their word.

1189
01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:17.000
So, my boy,
for the past millennium,

1190
01:00:17.000 --> 01:00:21.000
the Spirit Pearl has been
our only hope for freedom.

1191
01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:23.000
In one year's time,

1192
01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:26.000
I'll be able to completely
remove the horns on your head

1193
01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:29.000
and hide your identity
as a dada-- dragon.

1194
01:00:29.000 --> 01:00:32.000
If you're victorious
on the day of reckoning.

1195
01:00:32.000 --> 01:00:36.000
Then and only then will you
win a place in Heaven,

1196
01:00:36.000 --> 01:00:38.000
and be able
to break the dragons free

1197
01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:42.000
of this underwater purgatory.

1198
01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:46.000
Our fate rests entirely
on your shoulders.

1199
01:00:46.000 --> 01:00:49.000
Don't let yourself be fooled

1200
01:00:49.000 --> 01:00:53.000
by the illusion of friendship.

1201
01:00:57.000 --> 01:01:00.000
[Ne Zha singing]
¶ I'm a scary demon ¶

1202
01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:02.000
¶ Better run and hide ¶

1203
01:01:02.000 --> 01:01:05.000
¶ Legend says I'll eat and eat ¶

1204
01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:07.000
¶ 'Til everyone has died ¶

1205
01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:10.000
¶ And they're right
You should steer clear ¶

1206
01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:13.000
¶ Best take their suggestion ¶

1207
01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:15.000
¶ Cause when I eat too much ¶

1208
01:01:15.000 --> 01:01:18.000
¶ I get real bad indigestion ¶

1209
01:01:18.000 --> 01:01:21.000
[sighs deeply]

1210
01:01:23.000 --> 01:01:26.000
Please eat. You haven't had
anything in three days.

1211
01:01:26.000 --> 01:01:29.000
-[grunts]
-[clatters]

1212
01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:32.000
[Li Xin panting]

1213
01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:35.000
[sighs deeply]

1214
01:01:35.000 --> 01:01:38.000
Dear. How long are you going
to be like this?

1215
01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:40.000
Leave me alone.

1216
01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:43.000
I just wanna die in peace.

1217
01:01:43.000 --> 01:01:45.000
¶ I try to help but no one cares
so honestly why bother? ¶

1218
01:01:45.000 --> 01:01:46.000
Isn't jianzi your favorite, huh?

1219
01:01:46.000 --> 01:01:48.000
I could play with you right now.

1220
01:01:48.000 --> 01:01:49.000
¶ I'm tired
Of being a burden to ¶

1221
01:01:49.000 --> 01:01:51.000
I've designed a really neat
new training course

1222
01:01:51.000 --> 01:01:52.000
-in your painting...
- ¶ My mother and my father ¶

1223
01:01:52.000 --> 01:01:54.000
...called Ride the Clouds.

1224
01:01:54.000 --> 01:01:55.000
-¶ I kinda wish I wasn't here ¶
-Wanna give it a try?

1225
01:01:55.000 --> 01:01:58.000
¶ I'll close my eyes
And disappear ¶

1226
01:01:58.000 --> 01:02:02.000
[snoring]

1227
01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:10.000
Hey! Your third birthday's
only ten days away.

1228
01:02:10.000 --> 01:02:13.000
The people of Chentang Pass
want to celebrate with you.

1229
01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:15.000
Yeah?

1230
01:02:16.000 --> 01:02:17.000
[sighs]

1231
01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:21.000
They'd celebrate my funeral.
Not my birthday.

1232
01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:24.000
[scoffs]

1233
01:02:24.000 --> 01:02:27.000
The Sea Yaksha
can move as water,

1234
01:02:27.000 --> 01:02:28.000
without being noticed.

1235
01:02:28.000 --> 01:02:32.000
It's saliva can petrify people
and leaves a residue.

1236
01:02:32.000 --> 01:02:35.000
That misunderstanding
has been resolved.

1237
01:02:35.000 --> 01:02:37.000
They know you drove off
the demon.

1238
01:02:37.000 --> 01:02:39.000
Oh! Yes, your father's right.

1239
01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:42.000
The celebration's the thank you
for defeating that monster.

1240
01:02:42.000 --> 01:02:44.000
It would be.

1241
01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:45.000
I see my teachings
have paid off!

1242
01:02:45.000 --> 01:02:49.000
[scoffs]
Now those morons get it.

1243
01:02:49.000 --> 01:02:51.000
About time.

1244
01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:54.000
-Promise you'll be there?
-All right, fine!

1245
01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:04.000
[giggling, cheering]

1246
01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:07.000
[cloth rustles]

1247
01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:12.000
[slurps, giggles]

1248
01:03:15.000 --> 01:03:18.000
Why did you lie
about his birthday?

1249
01:03:18.000 --> 01:03:21.000
Believing he's the Spirit Pearl

1250
01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:23.000
has given him joy.

1251
01:03:23.000 --> 01:03:25.000
If it means
he can stay that way,

1252
01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:26.000
then yes, I'm going to lie.

1253
01:03:26.000 --> 01:03:28.000
Well, except...

1254
01:03:28.000 --> 01:03:31.000
the villagers were clear
they want to lock him up.

1255
01:03:31.000 --> 01:03:33.000
Why would they attend his party?

1256
01:03:35.000 --> 01:03:37.000
[Li Jing] Let me
handle the details.

1257
01:03:37.000 --> 01:03:38.000
On the beach that day,

1258
01:03:38.000 --> 01:03:40.000
I saw the Yaksha slime
on his hands.

1259
01:03:40.000 --> 01:03:42.000
He was telling the truth.

1260
01:03:42.000 --> 01:03:45.000
And I will see to it
that they all learn that,

1261
01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:46.000
at the celebration.

1262
01:03:46.000 --> 01:03:47.000
But...

1263
01:03:47.000 --> 01:03:50.000
When you've been commander
as long as I have,

1264
01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:53.000
many people owe you favors.

1265
01:03:53.000 --> 01:03:56.000
I'll get them all to attend.
You can count on that.

1266
01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:58.000
Don't worry.

1267
01:04:10.000 --> 01:04:13.000
-[blows air]
-[conch plays]

1268
01:04:20.000 --> 01:04:21.000
-[inhales deeply]
-[Ao Bing] What do you want?

1269
01:04:21.000 --> 01:04:23.000
[shrieks]

1270
01:04:23.000 --> 01:04:25.000
Ah, don't scare me like that.

1271
01:04:26.000 --> 01:04:27.000
My birthday party's in ten days.

1272
01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:31.000
And everyone in the Pass
is gonna be there.

1273
01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:35.000
I, uh, drew you a map
so you wouldn't get lost.

1274
01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:38.000
Li Manor's renowned.

1275
01:04:38.000 --> 01:04:40.000
I guess.
But you're coming, aren't ya?

1276
01:04:40.000 --> 01:04:42.000
-Well...
-Oh, come on!

1277
01:04:42.000 --> 01:04:45.000
I don't care if they don't come
but you gotta be there!

1278
01:04:45.000 --> 01:04:46.000
Why's that?

1279
01:04:46.000 --> 01:04:49.000
Maybe 'cause
you're my only friend.

1280
01:04:52.000 --> 01:04:55.000
You're my only friend, too.

1281
01:04:55.000 --> 01:04:57.000
Do you have any other wishes?

1282
01:04:57.000 --> 01:04:59.000
You saved my life.

1283
01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:02.000
So I'll do everything I can
to make them come true.

1284
01:05:02.000 --> 01:05:04.000
Wishes? Eh, like I said!

1285
01:05:04.000 --> 01:05:07.000
My wish is you'd come
to my party!

1286
01:05:08.000 --> 01:05:09.000
I'll go.

1287
01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:12.000
It's a deal! See you there!

1288
01:05:17.000 --> 01:05:19.000
Don't bail!

1289
01:05:19.000 --> 01:05:21.000
I won't.

1290
01:05:22.000 --> 01:05:25.000
[giggling]

1291
01:05:35.000 --> 01:05:36.000
[Shen] Ao Bing,

1292
01:05:36.000 --> 01:05:39.000
-[gasps]
-It's time to go.

1293
01:05:39.000 --> 01:05:42.000
One more thing.

1294
01:05:45.000 --> 01:05:47.000
[grunting]

1295
01:05:48.000 --> 01:05:51.000
Father!

1296
01:05:51.000 --> 01:05:54.000
[Dragon King exhales deeply]

1297
01:05:57.000 --> 01:06:00.000
Wait, what're you--

1298
01:06:01.000 --> 01:06:05.000
[grunting]

1299
01:06:08.000 --> 01:06:11.000
[scales shattering]

1300
01:06:13.000 --> 01:06:17.000
[chiming]

1301
01:06:25.000 --> 01:06:27.000
My son...

1302
01:06:27.000 --> 01:06:30.000
Each of the dragons
has given you

1303
01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:33.000
their hardest scale
for protection.

1304
01:06:33.000 --> 01:06:37.000
[Dragon King] Dragonscale armor
is impenetrable.

1305
01:06:37.000 --> 01:06:41.000
It's all up to you now.

1306
01:06:45.000 --> 01:06:48.000
[light music playing]

1307
01:06:57.000 --> 01:07:00.000
[light music continues playing]

1308
01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:02.000
Huh? Why're you so sad?

1309
01:07:02.000 --> 01:07:06.000
Show enthusiasm. Smile.

1310
01:07:08.000 --> 01:07:09.000
[groans]

1311
01:07:09.000 --> 01:07:11.000
Why does it sound
like a funeral?

1312
01:07:11.000 --> 01:07:14.000
[upbeat music playing]

1313
01:07:18.000 --> 01:07:19.000
When does Lord Li
want us to come out?

1314
01:07:19.000 --> 01:07:21.000
He'll signal.

1315
01:07:21.000 --> 01:07:23.000
Oh.

1316
01:07:28.000 --> 01:07:30.000
Hmm.
Yeah, I'm feelin' this cape.

1317
01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:34.000
Fancy!
[chuckling]

1318
01:07:34.000 --> 01:07:36.000
[Shen] A good shroud
for a corpse maybe.

1319
01:07:36.000 --> 01:07:38.000
What?

1320
01:07:38.000 --> 01:07:40.000
I am your ma-mast--

1321
01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:42.000
-[shatters]
-Ew, gross, a demon!

1322
01:07:42.000 --> 01:07:44.000
-[grunting]
-[Shen] Stop!

1323
01:07:44.000 --> 01:07:45.000
I know your master!

1324
01:07:45.000 --> 01:07:48.000
So I'm a friend to you!

1325
01:07:48.000 --> 01:07:51.000
Oh. Your name is
Shen something, right?

1326
01:07:51.000 --> 01:07:53.000
Shen Go-go-go--

1327
01:07:53.000 --> 01:07:54.000
What up, Shen Gonggong?

1328
01:07:54.000 --> 01:07:58.000
Brat. It's Shen Go-go-gong-bao!

1329
01:07:58.000 --> 01:08:02.000
And I'm here to reveal
your true identity.

1330
01:08:02.000 --> 01:08:05.000
-What do you mean "true"?
-[chuckles]

1331
01:08:05.000 --> 01:08:07.000
Oh, my poor child.

1332
01:08:07.000 --> 01:08:12.000
You have been kept in the dark
for far too long.

1333
01:08:15.000 --> 01:08:19.000
And now let's bring out
the birthday boy!

1334
01:08:19.000 --> 01:08:22.000
[lighting crackles]

1335
01:08:25.000 --> 01:08:28.000
[crowd murmuring]

1336
01:08:28.000 --> 01:08:32.000
[giggling]
Play with me!

1337
01:08:32.000 --> 01:08:34.000
-Huh?
-[whimpers]

1338
01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:41.000
Today is your birthday,
young apprentice.

1339
01:08:41.000 --> 01:08:44.000
And let me tell you
I'm gonna spoil you rotten!

1340
01:08:44.000 --> 01:08:47.000
[Taiyi grunts]

1341
01:08:48.000 --> 01:08:52.000
[upbeat music]

1342
01:08:55.000 --> 01:08:56.000
[spear whooshing]

1343
01:08:56.000 --> 01:09:00.000
[Taiyi] Your fire-tipped spear
and Chaotic Silk.

1344
01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:02.000
They're officially yours now.

1345
01:09:02.000 --> 01:09:05.000
And here's the big one!
[whistles]

1346
01:09:07.000 --> 01:09:10.000
[Taiyi] This shall serve
as your noble steed.

1347
01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:13.000
Go on, touch it.

1348
01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:16.000
[snorts]

1349
01:09:23.000 --> 01:09:26.000
This guy's
my most prized possession.

1350
01:09:26.000 --> 01:09:27.000
It can transform
into various mounts

1351
01:09:27.000 --> 01:09:29.000
based on the traits
of its owners.

1352
01:09:29.000 --> 01:09:32.000
With you, it will take the form
of a flaming chariot!

1353
01:09:32.000 --> 01:09:34.000
[laughing]

1354
01:09:34.000 --> 01:09:37.000
So why does it turn into a pig
with you then?

1355
01:09:37.000 --> 01:09:39.000
Huh?

1356
01:09:39.000 --> 01:09:41.000
[crowd gasping]

1357
01:09:41.000 --> 01:09:44.000
-[shrieks]
-[crowd murmur]

1358
01:09:47.000 --> 01:09:50.000
You stinker.
Where has the time gone?

1359
01:09:50.000 --> 01:09:51.000
Just three years ago,

1360
01:09:51.000 --> 01:09:53.000
you were a little meatball
in my belly.

1361
01:09:53.000 --> 01:09:57.000
And now you've become a man
with a personality and...

1362
01:09:57.000 --> 01:09:58.000
[sobs]

1363
01:09:58.000 --> 01:10:01.000
I so want to watch you grow up.

1364
01:10:06.000 --> 01:10:08.000
[sighs]
Why are you talking like that

1365
01:10:08.000 --> 01:10:10.000
on his birthday?

1366
01:10:10.000 --> 01:10:14.000
Dad got you a protection charm
to keep you safe.

1367
01:10:14.000 --> 01:10:16.000
I know I've always been
hard on you,

1368
01:10:16.000 --> 01:10:18.000
and you're angry about that.

1369
01:10:18.000 --> 01:10:21.000
But I was doing
what I thought best.

1370
01:10:21.000 --> 01:10:24.000
Now son, you have
a long life ahead.

1371
01:10:24.000 --> 01:10:26.000
Do not pay any attention
to what the others say.

1372
01:10:26.000 --> 01:10:29.000
You are who you say you are.

1373
01:10:29.000 --> 01:10:32.000
That's all that matters.

1374
01:10:32.000 --> 01:10:34.000
[scoffs]
I believed you.

1375
01:10:34.000 --> 01:10:36.000
But all you've done
was lie to me.

1376
01:10:36.000 --> 01:10:38.000
[gasps]
Why are you saying that?

1377
01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:41.000
Come on. The Demon Pill?

1378
01:10:41.000 --> 01:10:44.000
I know about everything.

1379
01:10:44.000 --> 01:10:46.000
You said I was the Spirit Pearl.

1380
01:10:46.000 --> 01:10:48.000
Put me through training
in the painting.

1381
01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:49.000
But really you were just

1382
01:10:49.000 --> 01:10:51.000
keeping me locked up
until I died.

1383
01:10:51.000 --> 01:10:53.000
All to make these idiots happy!

1384
01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:58.000
To keep your dumb reputation,
you locked me away!

1385
01:10:58.000 --> 01:11:00.000
Now you're being silly.

1386
01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:02.000
Don't be so dramatic.

1387
01:11:02.000 --> 01:11:03.000
I mean,
look at all these people!

1388
01:11:03.000 --> 01:11:06.000
Eating, drinking, being merry.

1389
01:11:06.000 --> 01:11:07.000
[laughing]

1390
01:11:07.000 --> 01:11:09.000
Why am I not surprised?

1391
01:11:09.000 --> 01:11:12.000
Fine. If you wanna
keep lying too.

1392
01:11:12.000 --> 01:11:15.000
With the power of sun and moon

1393
01:11:15.000 --> 01:11:17.000
-of sea and sand...
-Where did you learn that spell?

1394
01:11:17.000 --> 01:11:21.000
Qiankun Hoop, obey my command!

1395
01:11:23.000 --> 01:11:26.000
[clanks]

1396
01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:33.000
[clinks]

1397
01:11:39.000 --> 01:11:42.000
[ominous music]

1398
01:11:46.000 --> 01:11:50.000
[shrieks]
Run away!

1399
01:11:50.000 --> 01:11:52.000
[crowd clamoring]

1400
01:11:52.000 --> 01:11:54.000
Finally...

1401
01:11:54.000 --> 01:11:58.000
It's just you and me demon!

1402
01:11:58.000 --> 01:12:00.000
[grunts]

1403
01:12:01.000 --> 01:12:03.000
-[whooshes]
-[clanks]

1404
01:12:05.000 --> 01:12:09.000
[grunting]

1405
01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:21.000
[grunting continues]

1406
01:12:28.000 --> 01:12:31.000
[rumbling]

1407
01:12:32.000 --> 01:12:35.000
-[growling]
-Ne Zha! Stop this!

1408
01:12:35.000 --> 01:12:36.000
He's been possessed!

1409
01:12:36.000 --> 01:12:39.000
The Qiankun Hoop
is our only hope!

1410
01:12:39.000 --> 01:12:41.000
[Lady Yin] Find the hoop!

1411
01:12:42.000 --> 01:12:44.000
[Shen chuckles]
Looking for this?

1412
01:12:44.000 --> 01:12:48.000
[stutters]
Don't waste your time.

1413
01:12:48.000 --> 01:12:53.000
Only the heavenly calamity
can stop the Demon Pill.

1414
01:12:53.000 --> 01:12:55.000
Once he's killed Taiyi
and his parents,

1415
01:12:55.000 --> 01:12:57.000
go subdue Ne Zha.

1416
01:12:57.000 --> 01:13:00.000
Until the lightning
destroys him.

1417
01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:01.000
And when the dust clears,

1418
01:13:01.000 --> 01:13:04.000
the villagers will see you
as a hero.

1419
01:13:04.000 --> 01:13:08.000
After all that, the Supreme Lord
will turn you into a god.

1420
01:13:08.000 --> 01:13:11.000
Your power will be limitless.

1421
01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:14.000
Ne Zha's parents and Taiyi.

1422
01:13:14.000 --> 01:13:16.000
They are all innocent.

1423
01:13:16.000 --> 01:13:18.000
It's not right.
If the hoop was still on,

1424
01:13:18.000 --> 01:13:20.000
then Ne Zha wouldn't be evil.

1425
01:13:20.000 --> 01:13:22.000
What do you care
if he's good or evil?

1426
01:13:22.000 --> 01:13:25.000
He's about to get struck
by lightning!

1427
01:13:25.000 --> 01:13:28.000
[gasps]
If Taiyi and his parents survive

1428
01:13:28.000 --> 01:13:32.000
how will I sell our lie
to the Supreme Lord?

1429
01:13:37.000 --> 01:13:40.000
Fortune didn't smile upon me
when I was born.

1430
01:13:40.000 --> 01:13:43.000
I had to fight an uphill battle
to get this far.

1431
01:13:43.000 --> 01:13:46.000
Of all the disciples, I trained
the hardest,

1432
01:13:46.000 --> 01:13:48.000
never slacking.

1433
01:13:48.000 --> 01:13:51.000
Yet continually I was passed
over for the others.

1434
01:13:51.000 --> 01:13:55.000
Do-- Do you know why, my child?

1435
01:13:55.000 --> 01:13:56.000
No, master.

1436
01:13:56.000 --> 01:14:00.000
Because he knows I was born
a lowly jaguar spirit.

1437
01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:04.000
So he could care less
if I lived or died!

1438
01:14:04.000 --> 01:14:08.000
To everyone else,
you and I are just monsters.

1439
01:14:08.000 --> 01:14:11.000
They could construct
an entire mountain

1440
01:14:11.000 --> 01:14:14.000
with their prejudice.

1441
01:14:14.000 --> 01:14:16.000
And no matter how hard you try,
that mountain is immovable.

1442
01:14:16.000 --> 01:14:18.000
But you're being handed
a rare chance

1443
01:14:18.000 --> 01:14:20.000
to change their minds.

1444
01:14:20.000 --> 01:14:23.000
To alter your fate.

1445
01:14:23.000 --> 01:14:25.000
-Master. I owe Ne Zha my life.
-Huh?

1446
01:14:25.000 --> 01:14:27.000
Maybe I can't save him

1447
01:14:27.000 --> 01:14:30.000
but let me save his parents
and his master,

1448
01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:31.000
to repay my debt.

1449
01:14:31.000 --> 01:14:33.000
[growls]
Go.

1450
01:14:33.000 --> 01:14:35.000
-[clinks]
-Huh?

1451
01:14:35.000 --> 01:14:38.000
-Go on, then.
-[gasps]

1452
01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:42.000
But if, if,
if this goes south...

1453
01:14:42.000 --> 01:14:44.000
[stuttering]
don't say I didn't warn you boy.

1454
01:14:44.000 --> 01:14:49.000
If they discover what you are...
[laughing]

1455
01:14:49.000 --> 01:14:54.000
Then I promise more than four
will meet their fate today...

1456
01:14:54.000 --> 01:14:57.000
Uh... Hey. I was talking!

1457
01:14:57.000 --> 01:14:59.000
[both grunting]

1458
01:14:59.000 --> 01:15:01.000
-[clicking]
-[groans]

1459
01:15:01.000 --> 01:15:03.000
Nope!

1460
01:15:07.000 --> 01:15:10.000
-[grunts]
-[whooshing]

1461
01:15:12.000 --> 01:15:14.000
Huh?

1462
01:15:16.000 --> 01:15:19.000
[grunting]

1463
01:15:21.000 --> 01:15:23.000
[yelps]

1464
01:15:27.000 --> 01:15:29.000
[thuds]

1465
01:15:29.000 --> 01:15:31.000
[both grunt]

1466
01:15:31.000 --> 01:15:33.000
[screaming]

1467
01:15:36.000 --> 01:15:37.000
[sighs]

1468
01:15:37.000 --> 01:15:39.000
Stop! That's your father.

1469
01:15:39.000 --> 01:15:42.000
-[groans]
-[Ne Zha grunts]

1470
01:15:42.000 --> 01:15:45.000
-[screams]
-[whooshing]

1471
01:15:56.000 --> 01:15:59.000
Ah, he's so cool.

1472
01:16:01.000 --> 01:16:03.000
[ice crackling]

1473
01:16:15.000 --> 01:16:18.000
-[grunts]
-[whooshing]

1474
01:16:18.000 --> 01:16:22.000
[screaming]

1475
01:16:25.000 --> 01:16:27.000
Hear that?
We're missing the whole party.

1476
01:16:27.000 --> 01:16:28.000
Are you sure we can't go out?

1477
01:16:28.000 --> 01:16:30.000
Lord Li said there's a signal.

1478
01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:33.000
Oh. Oh, oh.

1479
01:16:36.000 --> 01:16:39.000
[grunts]

1480
01:16:42.000 --> 01:16:45.000
[ice shattering]

1481
01:16:48.000 --> 01:16:50.000
[gasps]

1482
01:16:56.000 --> 01:16:58.000
[Ao Bing] Use the Hoop!

1483
01:16:58.000 --> 01:16:59.000
Sun and moon, of sea and sand,

1484
01:16:59.000 --> 01:17:02.000
Qiankun Hoop, obey my command!

1485
01:17:08.000 --> 01:17:11.000
[gasps, grunting]

1486
01:17:13.000 --> 01:17:15.000
Hold!

1487
01:17:15.000 --> 01:17:18.000
-[clinks]
-[panting]

1488
01:17:25.000 --> 01:17:28.000
Ne Zha! Ne Zha!

1489
01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:34.000
Dear? It's your mother.

1490
01:17:35.000 --> 01:17:38.000
[crowd murmuring]

1491
01:17:40.000 --> 01:17:41.000
[growls]

1492
01:17:41.000 --> 01:17:42.000
[grunts]

1493
01:17:42.000 --> 01:17:46.000
[Lady Yin] Wait!

1494
01:17:56.000 --> 01:17:57.000
Please, wait.

1495
01:17:57.000 --> 01:17:59.000
Thank you for your assistance
today.

1496
01:17:59.000 --> 01:18:01.000
Tell me, what is your name?

1497
01:18:01.000 --> 01:18:03.000
My name isn't worth knowing,
Milord.

1498
01:18:03.000 --> 01:18:06.000
Nonsense, I must make a toast,
to thank you.

1499
01:18:06.000 --> 01:18:09.000
I have an urgent task
I must attend to.

1500
01:18:09.000 --> 01:18:11.000
[gasps]
I'm sorry. Let me get that.

1501
01:18:11.000 --> 01:18:14.000
-No need.
-[cloak whooshes]

1502
01:18:15.000 --> 01:18:18.000
-[glass shatters]
-[crowd gasp]

1503
01:18:19.000 --> 01:18:20.000
A dragon!

1504
01:18:20.000 --> 01:18:21.000
Weren't they imprisoned
in the Eastern Sea

1505
01:18:21.000 --> 01:18:24.000
by the Court of Heaven?
How did he get out?

1506
01:18:24.000 --> 01:18:27.000
I knew I detected
a familiar scent on you.

1507
01:18:27.000 --> 01:18:29.000
But that mark on your head
confirms my suspicions.

1508
01:18:29.000 --> 01:18:31.000
-[gasps]
-That sigil!

1509
01:18:31.000 --> 01:18:35.000
So the dragons stole
the Spirit Pearl.

1510
01:18:36.000 --> 01:18:37.000
I could chase you if I wanted!

1511
01:18:37.000 --> 01:18:40.000
What else would you expect from
a bunch of dragons?

1512
01:18:40.000 --> 01:18:42.000
[Taiyi] No wonder
your kind were locked away.

1513
01:18:42.000 --> 01:18:44.000
[crowd murmur]

1514
01:18:44.000 --> 01:18:45.000
Well, you can't cross
the dragons.

1515
01:18:45.000 --> 01:18:47.000
So, the dragons
were the thieves. Figures.

1516
01:18:47.000 --> 01:18:51.000
The Court of Heaven
shouldn't have left them alive.

1517
01:18:51.000 --> 01:18:54.000
[Shen] Tsk, tsk, tsk.

1518
01:18:54.000 --> 01:18:56.000
How unfortunate.

1519
01:18:56.000 --> 01:18:59.000
Brother?

1520
01:18:59.000 --> 01:19:02.000
For this to work
only four people needed to die.

1521
01:19:02.000 --> 01:19:03.000
But wouldn't you know?

1522
01:19:03.000 --> 01:19:05.000
Now everyone sees what you are.

1523
01:19:05.000 --> 01:19:08.000
Now no one
gets to su-sur-- survive.

1524
01:19:08.000 --> 01:19:10.000
Please tell me
you weren't involved.

1525
01:19:10.000 --> 01:19:13.000
I'm afraid I can't.
It would be quite rude to lie.

1526
01:19:13.000 --> 01:19:16.000
As for the Pearl, I stole it.

1527
01:19:16.000 --> 01:19:19.000
And Ao Bing is my apprentice.

1528
01:19:19.000 --> 01:19:22.000
Uh, have you lost your mind?

1529
01:19:22.000 --> 01:19:23.000
I'm gonna tell the Supreme Lord!

1530
01:19:23.000 --> 01:19:25.000
[laughing]

1531
01:19:25.000 --> 01:19:27.000
Good thing
I'm one step ahead then.

1532
01:19:27.000 --> 01:19:32.000
If you all die, there will be no
one left to tell him will there?

1533
01:19:32.000 --> 01:19:33.000
Apprentice,

1534
01:19:33.000 --> 01:19:37.000
there's only one thing
to be done.

1535
01:19:37.000 --> 01:19:40.000
The survival of your people

1536
01:19:40.000 --> 01:19:44.000
depends on the next decision.

1537
01:19:47.000 --> 01:19:49.000
[Dragon King]
For the past millennium,

1538
01:19:49.000 --> 01:19:54.000
the Spirit Pearl has been
our only hope for freedom.

1539
01:19:54.000 --> 01:19:57.000
It's all up to you now.

1540
01:19:57.000 --> 01:20:00.000
[roars]

1541
01:20:06.000 --> 01:20:08.000
[screaming]

1542
01:20:12.000 --> 01:20:16.000
[screaming continues]

1543
01:20:17.000 --> 01:20:20.000
-[crowd gasping]
-What is he doing?

1544
01:20:20.000 --> 01:20:23.000
[crowd clamoring]

1545
01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:33.000
[ominous music]

1546
01:20:39.000 --> 01:20:41.000
[grunts]

1547
01:20:44.000 --> 01:20:47.000
-[ice crackling]
-[wind howling]

1548
01:20:48.000 --> 01:20:50.000
[crowd murmuring]

1549
01:20:50.000 --> 01:20:52.000
He's trying
to bury Chentang Pass!

1550
01:20:52.000 --> 01:20:55.000
[crowd scream]

1551
01:20:57.000 --> 01:21:00.000
[thudding]

1552
01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:04.000
[tree creaking]

1553
01:21:06.000 --> 01:21:09.000
[Ne Zha panting]

1554
01:21:11.000 --> 01:21:13.000
[sighs deeply]

1555
01:21:18.000 --> 01:21:21.000
[sobbing]

1556
01:21:26.000 --> 01:21:29.000
[chiming]

1557
01:21:36.000 --> 01:21:38.000
[sneezes]

1558
01:21:48.000 --> 01:21:51.000
[Taiyi] A great deal of time
has already passed.

1559
01:21:51.000 --> 01:21:53.000
We should head back
as soon as possible.

1560
01:21:53.000 --> 01:21:56.000
Maybe there's something
we can do for him.

1561
01:21:57.000 --> 01:21:58.000
[blabbering]

1562
01:21:58.000 --> 01:22:00.000
You can't leave,
you just got here!

1563
01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:02.000
I, I'll die of loneliness!

1564
01:22:02.000 --> 01:22:04.000
You're being clingy!

1565
01:22:04.000 --> 01:22:07.000
[sighs]
You can't break this curse

1566
01:22:07.000 --> 01:22:09.000
but there are ways around it.

1567
01:22:09.000 --> 01:22:12.000
Like a transplant spell.
You thought about that?

1568
01:22:12.000 --> 01:22:14.000
Yeah, but what does he know?

1569
01:22:14.000 --> 01:22:16.000
Are you gonna trust me
or an annoying cloud?

1570
01:22:16.000 --> 01:22:19.000
I've studied with the Master
for centuries before you.

1571
01:22:19.000 --> 01:22:20.000
I know things you don't!

1572
01:22:20.000 --> 01:22:22.000
Let me show you
what talent looks like.

1573
01:22:22.000 --> 01:22:24.000
Yeah, okay, airhead.

1574
01:22:24.000 --> 01:22:25.000
[gagging]

1575
01:22:25.000 --> 01:22:27.000
These guys are
Fate-Swapping Runes.

1576
01:22:27.000 --> 01:22:29.000
Find a relative willing to
sacrifice their life.

1577
01:22:29.000 --> 01:22:31.000
Have them put one rune
on themselves,

1578
01:22:31.000 --> 01:22:33.000
and the other
on the cursed individual.

1579
01:22:33.000 --> 01:22:37.000
And then instead of him,
the relative will go boom!

1580
01:22:37.000 --> 01:22:39.000
-[blows raspberries]
-[gagging]

1581
01:22:47.000 --> 01:22:50.000
[groaning]
Ow.

1582
01:22:50.000 --> 01:22:51.000
[gasps]

1583
01:22:51.000 --> 01:22:53.000
Woah, hey! What are you doing?

1584
01:22:53.000 --> 01:22:56.000
I've decided to swap my life
for that of my son's.

1585
01:22:56.000 --> 01:22:57.000
This stays between you and me.

1586
01:22:57.000 --> 01:22:59.000
I beg of you,
don't tell my wife.

1587
01:22:59.000 --> 01:23:02.000
[sighs]
Milord...

1588
01:23:02.000 --> 01:23:04.000
Ultimately, your sacrifice
would just go to waste.

1589
01:23:04.000 --> 01:23:06.000
The Demon Pill
will bring disaster

1590
01:23:06.000 --> 01:23:08.000
and the Supreme Lord
will never let him go.

1591
01:23:08.000 --> 01:23:10.000
[Chang] The Demon Pill?

1592
01:23:10.000 --> 01:23:13.000
I will use the remaining
two years I have left

1593
01:23:13.000 --> 01:23:14.000
to make him a warrior.

1594
01:23:14.000 --> 01:23:16.000
The people shall see him
as a hero.

1595
01:23:16.000 --> 01:23:17.000
No, I can't allow it!

1596
01:23:17.000 --> 01:23:18.000
If you won't allow it,

1597
01:23:18.000 --> 01:23:20.000
when the lightning strikes
during the Heavenly Calamity,

1598
01:23:20.000 --> 01:23:22.000
I will die with Ne Zha.

1599
01:23:22.000 --> 01:23:24.000
That's, that's so not fair!

1600
01:23:24.000 --> 01:23:27.000
Uh, who is Ne Zha?

1601
01:23:27.000 --> 01:23:29.000
He is my son.

1602
01:23:34.000 --> 01:23:38.000
[somber music]

1603
01:23:49.000 --> 01:23:52.000
[sobbing]

1604
01:23:56.000 --> 01:24:00.000
[sniffles]

1605
01:24:05.000 --> 01:24:07.000
[screaming]
Stop!

1606
01:24:07.000 --> 01:24:10.000
[sword clinks]

1607
01:24:10.000 --> 01:24:12.000
-Ah!
-[clinks]

1608
01:24:14.000 --> 01:24:15.000
That's strong armor!

1609
01:24:15.000 --> 01:24:17.000
Aim for the head!

1610
01:24:19.000 --> 01:24:22.000
[ice crackling]

1611
01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:33.000
[whooshing]

1612
01:24:57.000 --> 01:24:58.000
[Ne Zha] Ao Bing?

1613
01:24:58.000 --> 01:25:01.000
[grunting]
Don't waste your breath.

1614
01:25:01.000 --> 01:25:03.000
Shen Gonggong?
What are you doing here?

1615
01:25:03.000 --> 01:25:06.000
It's Shen Gong-Bao!

1616
01:25:06.000 --> 01:25:08.000
Shen Gongbao was the one
who stole the Spirit Pearl

1617
01:25:08.000 --> 01:25:10.000
and put it in Ao Bing.

1618
01:25:10.000 --> 01:25:12.000
He wants to bury Chentang Pass
and everyone in it!

1619
01:25:12.000 --> 01:25:15.000
[people screaming]

1620
01:25:19.000 --> 01:25:21.000
Stop!

1621
01:25:25.000 --> 01:25:28.000
[upbeat music]

1622
01:25:37.000 --> 01:25:39.000
-[grunting]
-[sizzles]

1623
01:25:39.000 --> 01:25:42.000
[sizzling continues]

1624
01:25:45.000 --> 01:25:46.000
Your power is limited
by that hoop.

1625
01:25:46.000 --> 01:25:48.000
You've no chance.

1626
01:25:48.000 --> 01:25:51.000
I'll kick your butt!
Hoop or no hoop!

1627
01:25:52.000 --> 01:25:55.000
[weapons clanking]

1628
01:25:58.000 --> 01:26:00.000
[screaming]

1629
01:26:01.000 --> 01:26:04.000
[Ao Bing] Don't do this.

1630
01:26:06.000 --> 01:26:08.000
[Ne Zha] Ha! Too slow!

1631
01:26:08.000 --> 01:26:11.000
Fine. Then I'll ice you out!

1632
01:26:14.000 --> 01:26:18.000
-[Shen] Stop, my apprentice!
-[gasps]

1633
01:26:20.000 --> 01:26:22.000
[Ao Bing] I'm sorry, master!

1634
01:26:22.000 --> 01:26:23.000
[gasps]
Ne Zha!

1635
01:26:23.000 --> 01:26:24.000
[gasps]

1636
01:26:24.000 --> 01:26:27.000
[chuckles]

1637
01:26:27.000 --> 01:26:28.000
[both grunt]

1638
01:26:28.000 --> 01:26:29.000
[panting]

1639
01:26:29.000 --> 01:26:32.000
That's crazy!
What the heck are you wearing?

1640
01:26:32.000 --> 01:26:34.000
Transformation?
[growls]

1641
01:26:34.000 --> 01:26:37.000
[grunting]

1642
01:26:37.000 --> 01:26:40.000
Come and get me! You scared?

1643
01:26:40.000 --> 01:26:43.000
Demon, there can only be
one of us.

1644
01:26:44.000 --> 01:26:46.000
[both grunting]

1645
01:26:46.000 --> 01:26:48.000
[groaning]

1646
01:26:48.000 --> 01:26:51.000
[both grunting]

1647
01:26:55.000 --> 01:26:57.000
-Ah!
-[whip cracks]

1648
01:26:57.000 --> 01:26:58.000
You better watch yourself!

1649
01:26:58.000 --> 01:27:00.000
I was holding back
this whole time.

1650
01:27:00.000 --> 01:27:02.000
If anyone deserves to be the
12th Golden Immortal,

1651
01:27:02.000 --> 01:27:05.000
it's me, not an incompetent
fool like you!

1652
01:27:05.000 --> 01:27:07.000
-[blabbering]
-[thuds]

1653
01:27:08.000 --> 01:27:10.000
-Huh?
-[whooshes]

1654
01:27:10.000 --> 01:27:13.000
Hold on. Master entrusted you
with the painting,

1655
01:27:13.000 --> 01:27:15.000
not me?

1656
01:27:15.000 --> 01:27:16.000
Well, maybe he knew
you didn't deserve it!

1657
01:27:16.000 --> 01:27:18.000
[chuckles]
Very mature of you.

1658
01:27:18.000 --> 01:27:22.000
-But it's you who'll weep!
-Take that!

1659
01:27:22.000 --> 01:27:25.000
[whooshing]

1660
01:27:26.000 --> 01:27:28.000
[thuds, grunts]

1661
01:27:29.000 --> 01:27:31.000
[whimpering]

1662
01:27:31.000 --> 01:27:33.000
Coward!

1663
01:27:36.000 --> 01:27:38.000
[gasps]

1664
01:27:40.000 --> 01:27:41.000
[both groan, gasp]

1665
01:27:41.000 --> 01:27:45.000
-Huh?
-[zapping]

1666
01:27:45.000 --> 01:27:48.000
Huh? Ha?

1667
01:27:52.000 --> 01:27:54.000
I've got you now!

1668
01:27:54.000 --> 01:27:56.000
[stutters]
Stop! I am your master!

1669
01:27:56.000 --> 01:27:59.000
Nice try. Next time,
pay more attention to detail.

1670
01:28:03.000 --> 01:28:05.000
Apprentice, let me help you!

1671
01:28:05.000 --> 01:28:08.000
[grunting]

1672
01:28:09.000 --> 01:28:12.000
-[grunts]
-[Ao Bing] That'll teach you!

1673
01:28:15.000 --> 01:28:17.000
Great! Job well done!

1674
01:28:17.000 --> 01:28:18.000
You are too kind, Master.

1675
01:28:18.000 --> 01:28:20.000
-[spear rasps]
-[groans]

1676
01:28:22.000 --> 01:28:25.000
Thank you, apprentice!

1677
01:28:25.000 --> 01:28:27.000
[pants]

1678
01:28:29.000 --> 01:28:31.000
-Huh?
-Huh?

1679
01:28:31.000 --> 01:28:32.000
Uh hey...

1680
01:28:32.000 --> 01:28:36.000
[chuckles]
Totally nailed that! Huh?

1681
01:28:37.000 --> 01:28:38.000
[snarls]

1682
01:28:38.000 --> 01:28:41.000
[gasps]

1683
01:28:46.000 --> 01:28:49.000
-[chiming]
-No!

1684
01:28:53.000 --> 01:28:56.000
[screaming]

1685
01:29:01.000 --> 01:29:05.000
-Who are you?
-Why-- I'm your master!

1686
01:29:09.000 --> 01:29:10.000
-[clinks]
-[grunts]

1687
01:29:10.000 --> 01:29:13.000
Woah it's me, Ne Zha.

1688
01:29:13.000 --> 01:29:14.000
Ooh! That's sneaky!

1689
01:29:14.000 --> 01:29:16.000
Come on let's get out of here.

1690
01:29:19.000 --> 01:29:20.000
That brush is our only way out.

1691
01:29:20.000 --> 01:29:21.000
Get him!

1692
01:29:21.000 --> 01:29:24.000
[grunting]

1693
01:29:25.000 --> 01:29:27.000
[electricity crackling]

1694
01:29:28.000 --> 01:29:31.000
[grunts]

1695
01:29:40.000 --> 01:29:42.000
[screaming]

1696
01:29:47.000 --> 01:29:51.000
[grunting]

1697
01:30:02.000 --> 01:30:05.000
[suspenseful music]

1698
01:30:10.000 --> 01:30:12.000
[grunting]

1699
01:30:12.000 --> 01:30:14.000
Ao Bing, grab it.

1700
01:30:14.000 --> 01:30:17.000
[blows air]

1701
01:30:18.000 --> 01:30:21.000
[grunting, farts]

1702
01:30:24.000 --> 01:30:26.000
Hey, Ne Zha.
Grab the brush for me.

1703
01:30:26.000 --> 01:30:30.000
[grunting, farts]

1704
01:30:31.000 --> 01:30:34.000
Classy. But you can't
keep that up forever.

1705
01:30:34.000 --> 01:30:37.000
I, on the other hand, will never
run out of ammunition.

1706
01:30:37.000 --> 01:30:40.000
[inhales deeply]

1707
01:30:42.000 --> 01:30:44.000
[chuckles]
What was that you were saying?

1708
01:30:44.000 --> 01:30:48.000
[grunts, farts]

1709
01:30:49.000 --> 01:30:50.000
[laughs]
Good one!

1710
01:30:50.000 --> 01:30:53.000
[rumbles]

1711
01:30:54.000 --> 01:30:55.000
[all scream]

1712
01:30:55.000 --> 01:30:58.000
[paintbrush whooshing]

1713
01:31:06.000 --> 01:31:08.000
Uh, question,
where'd you learn to draw?

1714
01:31:08.000 --> 01:31:11.000
You try drawing with your feet.

1715
01:31:16.000 --> 01:31:19.000
[chiming]

1716
01:31:21.000 --> 01:31:24.000
[all screaming]

1717
01:31:25.000 --> 01:31:28.000
[all yelp]

1718
01:31:28.000 --> 01:31:31.000
[grunting]

1719
01:31:31.000 --> 01:31:33.000
[groans]

1720
01:31:33.000 --> 01:31:34.000
[sighs]

1721
01:31:34.000 --> 01:31:36.000
-Huh?
-Hm?

1722
01:31:36.000 --> 01:31:39.000
[both grunting]

1723
01:31:41.000 --> 01:31:44.000
[grunting continues]

1724
01:31:47.000 --> 01:31:49.000
[weapons clink]

1725
01:31:49.000 --> 01:31:51.000
[grunts]

1726
01:31:53.000 --> 01:31:56.000
[groans]

1727
01:32:01.000 --> 01:32:04.000
[panting, growls]

1728
01:32:04.000 --> 01:32:07.000
-Ne Zha! Ne Zha!
-Son! Son!

1729
01:32:08.000 --> 01:32:10.000
-Ah!
-[thuds]

1730
01:32:10.000 --> 01:32:13.000
[grunting]

1731
01:32:15.000 --> 01:32:18.000
[wind whooshes]

1732
01:32:19.000 --> 01:32:22.000
[whooshing continues]

1733
01:32:27.000 --> 01:32:30.000
[suspenseful music]

1734
01:32:36.000 --> 01:32:39.000
[people screaming]

1735
01:32:48.000 --> 01:32:51.000
Power of sun and moon,
of sea and sand.

1736
01:32:51.000 --> 01:32:53.000
Listen up, Qiankun Hoop,

1737
01:32:53.000 --> 01:32:56.000
and obey my command!

1738
01:32:56.000 --> 01:32:59.000
Can't lose myself. Gotta focus.

1739
01:32:59.000 --> 01:33:02.000
[flames roar]

1740
01:33:05.000 --> 01:33:08.000
[upbeat music]

1741
01:33:13.000 --> 01:33:14.000
[thuds]

1742
01:33:14.000 --> 01:33:17.000
[flames roaring]

1743
01:33:19.000 --> 01:33:22.000
[screaming]

1744
01:33:30.000 --> 01:33:33.000
[suspenseful music]

1745
01:33:45.000 --> 01:33:48.000
[people screaming]

1746
01:33:54.000 --> 01:33:56.000
Stop struggling.

1747
01:33:56.000 --> 01:33:59.000
You were born the Demon Pill.
Why not accept your destiny?

1748
01:33:59.000 --> 01:34:02.000
[groans]
'Cause it is not the boss of me.

1749
01:34:02.000 --> 01:34:04.000
I'm the master of my destiny.

1750
01:34:04.000 --> 01:34:06.000
I'll be the one who decides.

1751
01:34:06.000 --> 01:34:09.000
And I will not be a demon!

1752
01:34:14.000 --> 01:34:17.000
[screaming]

1753
01:34:19.000 --> 01:34:22.000
[gasps]

1754
01:34:24.000 --> 01:34:27.000
[whimpers]

1755
01:34:29.000 --> 01:34:32.000
[suspenseful music]

1756
01:34:35.000 --> 01:34:37.000
[gasps]

1757
01:34:46.000 --> 01:34:49.000
[whooshing]

1758
01:34:51.000 --> 01:34:53.000
[grunts]

1759
01:35:05.000 --> 01:35:07.000
-[rain pattering]
-Huh?

1760
01:35:07.000 --> 01:35:11.000
[rain pattering]

1761
01:35:17.000 --> 01:35:20.000
[calm music]

1762
01:35:26.000 --> 01:35:28.000
Why spare me?

1763
01:35:28.000 --> 01:35:30.000
[Ne Zha] I told you.

1764
01:35:30.000 --> 01:35:33.000
You're the only friend I have.

1765
01:35:37.000 --> 01:35:41.000
[thunder rumbles]

1766
01:35:42.000 --> 01:35:45.000
Well, my time's almost up.

1767
01:35:45.000 --> 01:35:46.000
You should leave.

1768
01:35:46.000 --> 01:35:48.000
[gasps]
But aren't you worried I'll...

1769
01:35:48.000 --> 01:35:50.000
I thought
you were the Spirit Pearl!

1770
01:35:50.000 --> 01:35:52.000
I'm the Demon Pill
and I'm braver than you?

1771
01:35:52.000 --> 01:35:54.000
Don't be such a baby!

1772
01:35:54.000 --> 01:35:56.000
I'm a monster.

1773
01:35:56.000 --> 01:35:58.000
When I was born,
my fate was sealed.

1774
01:35:58.000 --> 01:35:59.000
You're not listening.

1775
01:35:59.000 --> 01:36:01.000
Your fate's
what you want it to be.

1776
01:36:01.000 --> 01:36:03.000
No one else gets to decide
what you are.

1777
01:36:03.000 --> 01:36:05.000
My father taught that to me.

1778
01:36:05.000 --> 01:36:07.000
If fate comes at you swingin'...

1779
01:36:07.000 --> 01:36:10.000
then you hit back.

1780
01:36:14.000 --> 01:36:16.000
Ne Zha!

1781
01:36:16.000 --> 01:36:18.000
[both grunt]

1782
01:36:18.000 --> 01:36:21.000
Ne Zha! Release us!

1783
01:36:28.000 --> 01:36:30.000
I know you want to help but...

1784
01:36:30.000 --> 01:36:32.000
this is my fight.

1785
01:36:32.000 --> 01:36:35.000
Ne Zha! No!

1786
01:36:37.000 --> 01:36:40.000
[thunder rumbles]

1787
01:36:42.000 --> 01:36:45.000
Huh, you know
looking back on it...

1788
01:36:45.000 --> 01:36:47.000
Three years isn't that long.

1789
01:36:47.000 --> 01:36:50.000
I had fun while it lasted!

1790
01:36:55.000 --> 01:36:57.000
My only regret?

1791
01:36:57.000 --> 01:37:00.000
[Ne Zha] I never kicked
the jianzi with you, Dad.

1792
01:37:01.000 --> 01:37:03.000
[Lady Yin whimpers]

1793
01:37:04.000 --> 01:37:06.000
[sniffles, sobs]

1794
01:37:08.000 --> 01:37:12.000
It's my birthday.
No crying allowed.

1795
01:37:13.000 --> 01:37:17.000
[breathes deeply]

1796
01:37:17.000 --> 01:37:19.000
Aw, man.

1797
01:37:19.000 --> 01:37:23.000
[both sobbing]

1798
01:37:26.000 --> 01:37:29.000
[somber music]

1799
01:37:31.000 --> 01:37:33.000
Dad. Mom.

1800
01:37:33.000 --> 01:37:36.000
[sobbing]

1801
01:37:39.000 --> 01:37:41.000
[Ne Zha] Thank you.

1802
01:37:46.000 --> 01:37:50.000
[thunder rumbling]

1803
01:37:50.000 --> 01:37:53.000
[lighting crackling]

1804
01:37:56.000 --> 01:37:59.000
[somber music]

1805
01:38:00.000 --> 01:38:03.000
-Ne Zha! Ne Zha!
-Ne Zha! Ne Zha!

1806
01:38:03.000 --> 01:38:05.000
Ne Zha!

1807
01:38:10.000 --> 01:38:13.000
-Ne Zha! Ne Zha!
-Ne Zha! Ne Zha!

1808
01:38:13.000 --> 01:38:14.000
[Li Jing] Ne Zha!

1809
01:38:14.000 --> 01:38:17.000
[Lady Yin screaming]

1810
01:38:17.000 --> 01:38:20.000
[electricity whirring]

1811
01:38:20.000 --> 01:38:22.000
[lighting crackles]

1812
01:38:27.000 --> 01:38:30.000
[screaming]

1813
01:38:33.000 --> 01:38:36.000
[lighting crackling]

1814
01:38:38.000 --> 01:38:39.000
Huh?

1815
01:38:39.000 --> 01:38:41.000
Are you nuts?

1816
01:38:41.000 --> 01:38:43.000
Ao Bing, get out of there!

1817
01:38:43.000 --> 01:38:46.000
Dragonscale Armor!

1818
01:38:49.000 --> 01:38:53.000
[electricity crackling]

1819
01:39:00.000 --> 01:39:03.000
[shield clinking]

1820
01:39:05.000 --> 01:39:08.000
-[shatters]
-[both scream]

1821
01:39:09.000 --> 01:39:12.000
He is ruining my entire plan!

1822
01:39:12.000 --> 01:39:15.000
[grunts]
I'm not done with you.

1823
01:39:15.000 --> 01:39:18.000
[Shen] You've not seen
the last of me!

1824
01:39:18.000 --> 01:39:21.000
You're sacrificing yourself
for nothing.

1825
01:39:21.000 --> 01:39:22.000
You dumb or what?

1826
01:39:22.000 --> 01:39:25.000
'Course I am,
I'm your friend after all.

1827
01:39:25.000 --> 01:39:28.000
[chuckles]

1828
01:39:38.000 --> 01:39:42.000
[both grunting]

1829
01:39:52.000 --> 01:39:55.000
[chiming]

1830
01:40:04.000 --> 01:40:06.000
[gasps]

1831
01:40:06.000 --> 01:40:08.000
Huh?

1832
01:40:09.000 --> 01:40:11.000
[both grunt]

1833
01:40:14.000 --> 01:40:17.000
I never expected it could absorb
this amount of power.

1834
01:40:17.000 --> 01:40:20.000
The Chaos Pearl has an appetite.

1835
01:40:23.000 --> 01:40:26.000
[grunting]

1836
01:40:26.000 --> 01:40:28.000
I can't take it.

1837
01:40:28.000 --> 01:40:31.000
[Ne Zha] I'm about to explode!

1838
01:40:35.000 --> 01:40:37.000
[Ao Bing]
You shouldn't have to...

1839
01:40:37.000 --> 01:40:39.000
Let's give it back.

1840
01:40:39.000 --> 01:40:41.000
[Ne Zha] Right!
[grunts]

1841
01:40:48.000 --> 01:40:51.000
[ominous music]

1842
01:40:52.000 --> 01:40:55.000
I can't hold on!

1843
01:40:58.000 --> 01:41:02.000
-Ne Zha! No!
-[grunts]

1844
01:41:02.000 --> 01:41:06.000
How dare they not invite me
to join in...

1845
01:41:08.000 --> 01:41:11.000
I love a good party.

1846
01:41:11.000 --> 01:41:12.000
Stay strong, you two.

1847
01:41:12.000 --> 01:41:14.000
[both gasp]

1848
01:41:18.000 --> 01:41:21.000
[grunting]

1849
01:41:22.000 --> 01:41:24.000
[Taiyi] Open!

1850
01:41:26.000 --> 01:41:29.000
[chiming, clicks]

1851
01:41:32.000 --> 01:41:36.000
[crowd sighing]

1852
01:41:45.000 --> 01:41:47.000
Where are you? Ne Zha!

1853
01:41:47.000 --> 01:41:49.000
-[Lady Yin sobbing]
-[grunting]

1854
01:41:49.000 --> 01:41:52.000
-[clattering]
-[grunting]

1855
01:41:56.000 --> 01:41:58.000
[gasps]

1856
01:41:58.000 --> 01:42:00.000
[clattering]

1857
01:42:04.000 --> 01:42:06.000
[chimes]

1858
01:42:09.000 --> 01:42:10.000
[Ao Bing gasps]

1859
01:42:10.000 --> 01:42:13.000
-How are we alive?
-Ha! We made it!

1860
01:42:13.000 --> 01:42:14.000
[Taiyi] Well, not exactly...

1861
01:42:14.000 --> 01:42:17.000
[grunts]

1862
01:42:17.000 --> 01:42:21.000
The Multi-colored Lotus
couldn't save your bodies...

1863
01:42:21.000 --> 01:42:23.000
but it kept your souls intact.

1864
01:42:23.000 --> 01:42:25.000
Whereas I'm pretty sure
I blew my chance

1865
01:42:25.000 --> 01:42:27.000
at becoming
the 12th Golden Immortal.

1866
01:42:27.000 --> 01:42:29.000
It cost me centuries!

1867
01:42:29.000 --> 01:42:31.000
Now I guess I gotta start over
again from scratch!

1868
01:42:31.000 --> 01:42:33.000
Thank goodness.

1869
01:42:33.000 --> 01:42:36.000
I thought
I'd never see you again!

1870
01:42:36.000 --> 01:42:40.000
[Lady Yin wailing]

1871
01:42:46.000 --> 01:42:49.000
[light music]

1872
01:43:00.000 --> 01:43:02.000
[Taiyi] If you asked me

1873
01:43:02.000 --> 01:43:05.000
whether a person
can alter their fate?

1874
01:43:05.000 --> 01:43:07.000
Well, I don't really know.

1875
01:43:07.000 --> 01:43:10.000
But hey, anything's possible.

1876
01:43:10.000 --> 01:43:12.000
Because a boy named Ne Zha,

1877
01:43:12.000 --> 01:43:14.000
forever changed his.

1878
01:43:15.000 --> 01:43:18.000
[upbeat music]

1879
01:43:48.000 --> 01:43:50.000
-[grunting]
-Okay,

1880
01:43:50.000 --> 01:43:52.000
but, are you sure
we can't go out?

1881
01:43:52.000 --> 01:43:54.000
We, we're still waiting
on the signal!

1882
01:43:54.000 --> 01:43:58.000
So uh what exactly
is the signal?

1883
01:43:58.000 --> 01:44:00.000
You know...

1884
01:44:00.000 --> 01:44:01.000
That's a good question.

1885
01:44:01.000 --> 01:44:04.000
[both gasp]

1886
01:44:07.000 --> 01:44:08.000
DON'T LEAVE!

1887
01:44:08.000 --> 01:44:11.000
THERE'S STILL
POST-CREDITS SCENE!

1888
01:44:12.000 --> 01:44:15.000
[upbeat music]

1889
01:45:25.000 --> 01:45:28.000
[growling]

1890
01:45:28.000 --> 01:45:31.000
[Dragon King] Ao Bing...

1891
01:45:31.000 --> 01:45:36.000
Everything we have worked for
was laid to waste.

1892
01:45:36.000 --> 01:45:42.000
And for that, I will make all
of Chentang Pass pay in blood.

1893
01:45:43.000 --> 01:45:46.000
[laughing]
Louder,

1894
01:45:46.000 --> 01:45:50.000
I don't think they can hear you!

1895
01:45:50.000 --> 01:45:52.000
Screaming into the void
like a child

1896
01:45:52.000 --> 01:45:55.000
won't change a thing.

1897
01:45:55.000 --> 01:45:58.000
We trusted you
to secure our freedom,

1898
01:45:58.000 --> 01:46:01.000
and you failed us!

1899
01:46:03.000 --> 01:46:06.000
Would you like to make a deal?

1900
01:46:06.000 --> 01:46:08.000
Dear brother?

1901
01:46:08.000 --> 01:46:12.000
[giggles]

1902
01:46:14.000 --> 01:46:15.000
DON'T YOU DARE LEAVE!

1903
01:46:15.000 --> 01:46:17.000
THERE ARE STILL
POST-CREDIT SCENE TO SEE

1904
01:49:19.000 --> 01:49:21.000
[disembodied voice]
Jiang Ziya...

1905
01:49:21.000 --> 01:49:24.000
[shivering]

1906
01:49:25.000 --> 01:49:28.000
You know your sin.

1907
01:49:31.000 --> 01:49:35.000
2020
THE WAR TO SEAL THE GODS AWAY

